#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible integration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Currently, the supported version of Ansible is 2.9 (LTS) shipped in SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools channels.  The supported OS version for the "
"Ansible Control Node is {sles} 15 SP3, or later.  Ansible software is also "
"available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} Branch Server.  "
"For Control Nodes running operating systems other than {sle}, use Ansible "
"shipped together with your distribution."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ, ເວີຊັນຂອງ Ansible ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 2.9 (LTS) ທີ່ມີມາໃນຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools. ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Ansible Control Node ແມ່ນ {sles} 15 SP3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຊອບແວ Ansible ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server. ສຳລັບ Control Node ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {sle}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ansible ທີ່ມາກັບຊຸດຊອບແວ (distribution) ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to operate their Ansible Control "
"Nodes.  Supported features are:"
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ Ansible Control Nodes ໄດ້. ຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:5
msgid "inspection of inventory files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:6
msgid "discovery of playbooks"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:7
msgid "execution of playbooks"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:8
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The inventory is a sorted list of managed Ansible nodes.  For more "
"information about organizing an inventory, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."
msgstr "Inventory ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ຈັດລຽງຂອງ Ansible nodes ທີ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ inventory ໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Playbooks are a way to describe how the inventory is to be managed.  For "
"more information about playbooks, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."
msgstr "Playbooks ແມ່ນວິທີການອະທິບາຍວ່າຈະຈັດການ inventory ແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and basic configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To use Ansible features, you need to register the already existing Ansible "
"Control Node as a Salt client to the {productname} Server.  In the {webui}, "
"on the menu:System Details[Properties] page of the registered system, you "
"must enable the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type of the "
"[guimenu]``Add-on System Types`` list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enabling the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type ensures that the "
"[package]``ansible`` package is installed on the system by adding it in the "
"highstate and activates the Ansible features under the menu:System "
"Details[Ansible] tab."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ປະເພດລະບົບ ``Ansible Control Node`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າແພັກເກັດ [package]``ansible`` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໂດຍການເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ highstate ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ Ansible ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ menu:System Details[Ansible]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"As the next step, configure the paths to your Ansible playbook directories "
"and inventory files on the menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node] "
"page.  As an inventory path, you can use the standard Ansible inventory path "
"[literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``.  As a playbook directory, you can use any "
"directory on the control node, where your playbook files are stored.  A "
"playbook directory either contains [literal]``.yml`` files or subdirectories "
"with [literal]``.yml`` files."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ playbook directories ແລະ inventory files ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node]. ສຳລັບ inventory path, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``. ສຳລັບ playbook directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂຟນເດີໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນ control node ທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ playbook ໄວ້. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບັນຈຸໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml`` ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For installing and setting up an Ansible Control Node, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory inspection"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"After defining an inventory path, you can use {productname} to inspect its "
"contents."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ inventory path ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອກວດສອບເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Inspecting an inventory from the {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Inventories]"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Ansible > Inventories]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Click an inventory path to execute the inventory inspection on the Control "
"Node in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ inventory path ເພື່ອເລີ່ມກວດສອບ inventory ເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ (real-time)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook discovery"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"After defining a playbook directory, you can discover playbooks on the "
"menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks] page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ playbook directory ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"As with the inventory inspection, the playbook discovery operations run on "
"the Control Node in real-time."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການກວດສອບ inventory, ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbook ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook execution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can schedule a playbook execution from the menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Playbooks] page.  After selecting the playbook you wish to execute, you can "
"select the inventory file for the execution from the [guimenu]``Inventory "
"Path`` drop-down menu of the [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution`` "
"dialog.  If you do not select any item, the default inventory configured in "
"your Control Node will be used.  The drop-down menu is populated with the "
"inventories you defined in your Inventory paths and with inventories that "
"have been locally discovered in your playbook directories.  These are "
"displayed as [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` items in the playbook details.  "
"You can also enter an arbitrary inventory path."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການປະມວນຜົນ playbook ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]. ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ playbook ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟລ໌ inventory ໄດ້ຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution``. ຖ້າບໍ່ເລືອກອັນໃດ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ inventory ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Control Node. ລາຍການໃນເມນູນີ້ຈະມາຈາກ inventory ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ ຈາກການຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນ playbook directories ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງເປັນ [guimenu]``Custom Inventory``. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງ inventory ໃດກໍໄດ້ເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Afterwards, you choose the time of the playbook execution or select an "
"action chain.  Eventually, {productname} executes the playbook as an action "
"on the Control Node.  You can see the result of the operation on the action "
"details page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ເລືອກ action chain. ໃນທີ່ສຸດ {productname} ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ playbook ເປັນການດຳເນີນການໜຶ່ງເທິງ Control Node. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Ansible control node"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up an Ansible control node, execute the following steps from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible control node, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up an Ansible control node"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products], verify that [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP5 "
"x86_64`` and [literal]``SUSE Manager Client Tools for SLE 15 x86_64`` are "
"selected and synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:5
msgid "Deploy a {sles} 15 SP5 client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the menu:Systems[Overview] page of "
"the client.  Select menu:Software[Software Channels] and subscribe the "
"client to the [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP5 x86_64`` and "
"[literal]``SUSE Manager Client Tools for SLE 15 x86_64`` channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:7
msgid "The {productname} client tools contain the [package]``ansible`` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Select menu:Details[Properties] of your client.  From the [literal]``Add-On "
"System Types`` list enable [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` and click "
"btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Details[Properties] ຂອງ Client. ຈາກລາຍການ [literal]``Add-On System Types`` ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the client overview page, select menu:State[Highstate], and "
"click btn:[Apply Highstate]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າພາບລວມຂອງ Client, ເລືອກ menu:State[Highstate], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:10
msgid "Select the menu:Events[] tab and verify the status of the highstate."
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Events[] ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ highstate."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For executing remediations you need to install the SCAP security guide "
"package on the Ansible control node."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide ໃນ Ansible control node."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:14
msgid ""
"From menu:Systems[Overview], select the client.  Then click "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install]."
msgstr "ຈາກ menu:Systems[Overview], ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ແລ້ວຄລິກ menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Search for [package]``scap-security-guide`` and install the package suitable "
"for your system.  See the following table for package distribution "
"requirements:"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງແຕ່ລະລະບົບ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP security guide package requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package name\n"
"| Supported Systems\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide\n"
"| {opensuse}, SLES12, SLES15\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS 7, CentOS 8, Fedora, Oracle Linux 7, Oracle Linux 8, RHEL7, RHEL8, "
"RHEL9, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 10, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 13, Red Hat "
"Virtualization 4, Scientific Linux\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-debian\n"
