#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [parameter]``Module "
"(Stream)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``Module (Stream)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``equals``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, type a module name."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂມດູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
msgid "For example, [parameter]``postgresql``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``postgresql``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:134
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສາຍໂມດູນ (stream) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``10``.  If you leave this field blank, the default "
"stream for the module is selected."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``10``. ຫາກທ່ານປ່ອຍຊ່ອງນີ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ, ສາຍໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂມດູນນັ້ນຈະຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid ""
"Click btn:``Attach/Detach Filters``, select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the ``Create/Edit Filter`` form to select "
"a module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການເລືອກເບິ່ງ (browse) ໃນແບບຟອມ ``Create/Edit Filter`` ເພື່ອເລືອກໂມດູນຈາກລາຍຊື່ສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງ modular."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing Available Module Streams"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
msgid "Click ``Browse available modules`` to see all modular channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ ``Browse available modules`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງ modular ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອເບິ່ງໂມດູນ ແລະ ສາຍໂມດູນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:149
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, start typing a module name to search, "
"or select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໂມດູນເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, start typing a stream name to search, or "
"select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ສາຍໂມດູນເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ນເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການເບິ່ງໂມດູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ ໄວ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆ ຕໍ່ຂະບວນການ CLM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບສາຍໂມດູນອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສາຍໂມດູນໃດໆ ທີ່ສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (dependencies) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາລະມັດລະວັງໃນການລະບຸສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້, ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເລືອກສອງສາຍໂມດູນຈາກໂມດູນດຽວກັນແມ່ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling Modularity"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter] ແລະ ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``none (disable "
"modularity)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປັນການນຳເອົາ metadata ຂອງໂມດູນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ໂດຍຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:165
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນ {webui}, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍຈະກາຍເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ມີໂມດູນໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍແພັກເກັດຈາກສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ modularity ທັງໝົດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມີບັນຫາ ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງໂມດູນແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິໃນ {rhel}{nbsp}8."

#.  For 4.3 only:
#.  This feature is mandatory to make RHEL/CentOS 8 modular repositories work
#.  in the SUMA UI. Otherwise, even though modular repositories can be synced
#.  and assigned to clients, they cannot be used for package operations
#.  (install, update, etc.) from SUMA UI (An info message is shown in the UI if
#.  that's the case). In that case, the package operations can only be done
#.  from the client's CLI manually.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ທົດສອບແພັກເກັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການອັບເດດ ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນໄຄເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດສຳເນົາ (clone) ພວກມັນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມານັ້ນໄດ້ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນທົດສອບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ຖືກສຳເນົາມາຈະກົງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຈະເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (dependencies) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການເລືອກ ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມາໄດ້ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການທົດສອບທັງໝົດຜ່ານແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນລະດັບ (promote) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມາ ໄປຍັງ server ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ ໄປຕາມວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງມັນ. ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ (test) ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດມີຫຼາຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນພື້ນຖານຂອງວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ. ໂປຣເຈັກຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນການສ້າງ (build environments)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Label`` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, "
"periods, hyphens, and underscores."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label`` ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດພິມນ້ອຍ, ຕົວເລກ, ຈຸດ (.), ຂີດຕໍ່ (-), ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (_) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍເຖິງໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ກັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Sources`` dialog, select the source type, and select a "
"base channel for your project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Sources``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (source type), ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel) ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ຫຼື ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອຮັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຄວນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to "
"the project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` dialog, give the first environment "
"a name, a label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່, ປ້າຍຊື່, ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະໄດ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄົບຕາມວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the [guimenu]``Insert before`` field when you create it."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນວົງຈອນຊີວິດໄດ້ ໂດຍການເລືອກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Insert before`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເນື້ອຫາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ. ຕົວຕອງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າແພັກເກັດໃດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກການສ້າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກັດ kernel ທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ລວມສະເພາະບາງລຸ້ນ (releases) ຂອງບາງແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັກເກັດ (package filtering)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "by name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid "by name, epoch, version, release, and architecture"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່, epoch, ເວີຊັນ, release, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "by provided name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ (provided name)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "patch filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັດຊ໌ (patch filtering)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "by advisory name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (advisory name)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "by advisory type"
msgstr "ຕາມປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid "by synopsis"
msgstr "ຕາມບົດສະຫຼຸບ (synopsis)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "by keyword"
msgstr "ຕາມຄຳສຳຄັນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "by date"
msgstr "ຕາມວັນທີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "by affected package"
msgstr "ຕາມແພັກເກັດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "by stream"
msgstr "ຕາມສາຍ (stream)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid "Package dependencies are not resolved during content filtering."
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ແພັກເກັດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (Package dependencies) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (resolved) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕອງເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"There are multiple matchers you can use with the filter.  Which ones are "
"available depends on the filter type you choose."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (matchers) ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ. ສິ່ງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຕົວຕອງທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:49
msgid "The available matchers are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (matchers) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:50
msgid "contains"
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍ (contains)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:51
msgid "matches (must take the form of a regular expression)"
msgstr "ກົງກັບ (matches) (ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ regular expression)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:52
msgid "equals"
msgstr "ເທົ່າກັບ (equals)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:53
msgid "greater"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ (greater)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:54
msgid "greater or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ (greater or equal)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:55
msgid "lower or equal"
msgstr "ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ (lower or equal)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:56
msgid "lower"
msgstr "ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ (lower)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:57
msgid "later or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ ຫຼື ໃນວັນທີ (later or equal)"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter ``rule`` Parameter"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``rule`` ຂອງຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Each filter has a ``rule`` parameter that can be set to either ``Allow`` or "
"``Deny``.  The filters are processed like this:"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງຈະມີພາຣາມິເຕີ ``rule`` ທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``Allow`` (ອະນຸຍາດ) ຫຼື ``Deny`` (ປະຕິເສດ). ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies a ``Deny`` filter, it is excluded from the "
"result."
msgstr "ຫາກແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ ກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງຕົວຕອງ ``Deny``, ມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກຜົນລັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies an ``Allow`` filter, it is included in the "
"result (even if it was excluded by a ``Deny`` filter). ``Allow`` filters for "
"packages only operate on package filters and ``Allow`` filters for patches "
"only operate on patch filters. This means with a package filter you cannot "
"add packages back in that were filtered out through patch filters or vice "
"versa for patches that where filtered out through package filters."
msgstr "ຫາກແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ ກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງຕົວຕອງ ``Allow``, ມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຜົນລັບ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໂດຍຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ມາກ່ອນກໍຕາມ). ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດ ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຕົວຕອງແພັກເກັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັດຊ໌ ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຕົວຕອງແພັດຊ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງແພັກເກັດ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຕອງອອກໂດຍຕົວຕອງແພັດຊ໌ກັບຄືນມາໄດ້, ຫຼື ໃນທາງກັບກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This behavior is useful when you want to exclude large number of packages or "
"patches using a general ``Deny`` filter and \"cherry-pick\" specific "
"packages or patches with specific ``Allow`` filters."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳແບບນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ເລືອກສະເພາະບາງແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (cherry-pick) ດ້ວຍຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສະເພາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Content filters are global in your organization and can be shared between "
"projects."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງເນື້ອຫາແມ່ນມີຜົນໃນລະດັບສາກົນພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນລະຫວ່າງໂປຣເຈັກຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If your project already contains built sources, when you add an environment "
"it is automatically populated with the existing content.  Content is drawn "
"from the previous environment of the cycle if it had one.  If there is no "
"previous environment, it is left empty until the project sources are built "
"again."
msgstr "ຫາກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງ (built) ໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ ມັນຈະຖືກດຶງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຢູ່ມາໃສ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້າ ໃນຮອບວຽນ (ຫາກມີ). ຫາກບໍ່ມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້າ, ມັນຈະຖືກປະໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ ຈົນກວ່າແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter Templates"
msgstr "ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (Filter Templates)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To help with creating filters for some common scenarios, {productname} "
"offers filter templates.  When applied, these templates help creating a set "
"of filters in advance, tailored for a specific use case."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງຕົວຕອງສຳລັບບາງສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປ, {productname} ມີແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງຊຸດຕົວຕອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:67
msgid "This section describes available templates and their usages."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເຖິງແມ່ແບບທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a SUSE product"
msgstr "ການແພັດສົດ (Live patching) ອີງຕາມຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In a project that contains live patching, regular future kernel packages "
"must be excluded so that only live patch packages are offered as updates to "
"clients. On the other hand, already installed regular kernel packages must "
"still be included to keep system integrity."
msgstr "ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ມີ live patching, ແພັກເກັດ kernel ແບບປົກກະຕິໃນອະນາຄົດຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ແພັກເກັດ live patch ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະເໜີເປັນການອັບເດດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ. ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, ແພັກເກັດ kernel ແບບປົກກະຕິທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວ ຈະຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກລວມໄວ້ ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມຄົບຖ້ວນຂອງລະບົບ (system integrity)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:70
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates three filters required to achieve this "
"behavior:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງສາມຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:71
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Allow patches that contain ``kernel-default`` package equal to a base kernel "
"version"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ (Allow) ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດ ``kernel-default`` ເທົ່າກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ base kernel"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:74
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up a live patching project, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ live patching, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:75
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:93
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying the template"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template]. The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix. This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every individual filter created by the template. If "
"the template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will "
"be prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່ (prefix). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ ທາງໜ້າຊື່ຂອງທຸກໆ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຫາກແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ຊ່ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a SUSE product``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a SUSE product``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Product`` field, select the product you wish to set up "
"live patching for."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Product``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ live patching ໃຫ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions available in the selected product. The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນຂອງ kernel ຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງເພື່ອປະຕິເສດ kernel patches ປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ຈະອີງໃສ່ເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:82
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:100
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the filters."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:85
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Select the three filters that have the specified prefix, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສາມຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix) ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a system"
msgstr "Live patching ທີ່ອີງຕາມລະບົບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:87
msgid ""
"When you want to set up a live patching project based on a kernel version "
"installed in a specific registered system, you can use the \"live patching "
"based on a system\" template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ live patching ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ເວີຊັນ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ໃນລະບົບສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ \"live patching based on a system\" ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:95
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template].  The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:96
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix.  This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every filter created by the template.  If the "
"template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will be "
"prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທາງໜ້າ ຊື່ຂອງທຸກໆ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຫາກແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ຊ່ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:97
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a specific system``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a specific system``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System`` field, select a system from the list, or start "
"typing a system name to narrow down the options."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``System``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລະບົບຈາກລາຍຊື່, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ລະບົບ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກແຄບລົງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions installed in the selected system.  The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນ kernel ຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ໃນລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງເພື່ອປະຕິເສດ kernel patches ປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ຈະອີງໃສ່ເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream modules with defaults"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ AppStream ພ້ອມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:105
msgid ""
"When you want to have all the modules available in a modular repository "
"included in your project, you can automatically add them using this filter "
"template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບ modular ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:106
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates an AppStream filter per module and its "
"default stream."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂມດູນ ແລະ ສາຍໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:107
msgid ""
"If this process is done from the project's page, the filters are added to "
"the project automatically. Otherwise, the created filters can be listed in "
"menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] and be added to any project as needed."
msgstr "ຫາກຂະບວນການນີ້ເຮັດຈາກໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ, ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Each individual filter can be edited to select a different module stream, or "
"removed altogether to exclude that module from the target repositories."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້, ຫຼື ສາມາດລຶບອອກທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໂມດູນນັ້ນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Because not all module streams are compatible with each other, changing "
"individual streams may prevent successful resolution of modular "
"dependencies. When this happens, the filters pane in the project details "
"page will show an error describing the problem, and the build button will be "
"disabled until all the module selections are compatible."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກສາຍໂມດູນຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້, ການປ່ຽນແປງແຕ່ລະສາຍໂມດູນ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂ modular dependencies ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການນີ້, ແຜງຕົວຕອງໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດໂປຣເຈັກຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອະທິບາຍເຖິງບັນຫາ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມ build ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຈົນກວ່າການເລືອກໂມດູນທັງໝົດຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Since {rhel}{nbsp}9, modules do not have any defined default streams.  "
"Therefore, using this template with {rhel}{nbsp}9 sources will have no "
"effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດສາຍໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບນີ້ກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:111
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up AppStream repositories with content "
"lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ດ້ວຍການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:113
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select your project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` section, click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and "
"then click btn:[Create New Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Create New Filter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:117
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``AppStream modules with "
"defaults``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``AppStream modules with defaults``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:118
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Channel`` field, select a modular channel to get the "
"modules from. In this dropdown, only the modular channels are displayed."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ modular ເພື່ອດຶງໂມດູນອອກມາ. ໃນລາຍການເລືອກນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງ modular ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Scroll to the [guimenu]``Filters`` section to see the newly attached "
"AppStream filters."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນລົງໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ທີ່ຫາກໍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:121
msgid ""
"You can edit/remove any individual filter to tailor the project to your "
"needs."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ/ລຶບ ຕົວຕອງແຕ່ລະອັນໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂປຣເຈັກໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ສ້າງ (Build) ໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When you have created your project, defined environments, and attached "
"sources and filters, you can build the project for the first time."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ, ກຳນົດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລວມທັງຕົວຕອງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Building applies filters to the attached sources and clones them to the "
"first environment in the project."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (Building) ຈະເປັນການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ ແລະ ສຳເນົາ (clone) ພວກມັນໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:125
msgid ""
"You can use the same vendor channels as sources for multiple content "
"projects.  In this case, {productname} does not create new patch clones for "
"each cloned channel.  Instead, a single patch clone is shared between all of "
"your cloned channels.  This can cause problems if a vendor modifies a patch; "
"for example, if the patch is retracted, or the packages within the patch are "
"changed.  When you build one of the content projects, all the channels that "
"share the cloned patch are synchronized with the original by default, even "
"if the channels are in other environments of your content project, or other "
"content project channels in your organization.  You can change this behavior "
"by turning off automatic patch synchronization in your organization "
"settings.  To manually synchronize the patch later for all channels sharing "
"the patch, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you want to synchronize and navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` subtab.  Even "
"manual patch synchronization affects all organization channels sharing the "
"patch."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດດຽວກັນເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຫຼາຍໆ ໂປຣເຈັກເນື້ອຫາໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງ patch clones ໃໝ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມາ. ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ patch clone ດຽວກັນຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມາຂອງທ່ານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກຜູ້ຜະລິດມີການແກ້ໄຂແພັດຊ໌; ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກແພັດຊ໌ຖືກຖອນອອກ, ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດພາຍໃນແພັດຊ໌ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກເນື້ອຫາອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ, ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ patch clone ນັ້ນຮ່ວມກັນ ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຈະຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອື່ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກເນື້ອຫາຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂປຣເຈັກເນື້ອຫາອື່ນໆ ໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານກໍຕາມ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໄດ້ ໂດຍການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຊ໌ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຊ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນພາຍຫຼັງສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ນັ້ນຮ່ວມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຄລິກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Sync``. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຊ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ມັນກໍຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃນອົງກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ນັ້ນຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to build."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:128
msgid "Make sure you have the environment available before building the project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:129
msgid "Review the attached sources and filters, and click btn:[Build]."
msgstr "ກວດທານແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:130
msgid "Provide a version message to describe the changes or updates in this build."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນເພື່ອອະທິບາຍເຖິງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນການສ້າງຄັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:131
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:138
msgid ""
"You can monitor build progress in the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` "
"section."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການສ້າງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:132
msgid ""
"After the build is finished, the environment version is increased by one and "
"the built sources, such as software channels, can be assigned to your "
"clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເວີຊັນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promote Environments"
msgstr "ຍົກລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:134
msgid ""
"When the project has been built, the built sources can be sequentially "
"promoted to the environments."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂຄງການຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກຍົກລະດັບໄປຫາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆຕາມລຳດັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting Environments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:137
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` section, locate the environment to "
"promote to its successor, and click btn:[Promote]."
msgstr "ໃນພາກ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ຊອກຫາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຈະຍົກລະດັບໄປຫາລຳດັບຖັດໄປ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Promote]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign Clients to Environments"
msgstr "ກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:140
msgid ""
"When you build and promote content lifecycle projects, {productname} creates "
"a tree of software channels.  To add clients to the environment, assign the "
"base and child software channels to your client using menu:Software[Software "
"Channels] in the [guimenu]``System Details`` page for the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ຍົກລະດັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, {productname} ຈະສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ: Software[Software Channels] ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Newly added cloned channels are not assigned to clients automatically.  If "
"you add or promote sources you need to manually check and update your "
"channel assignments."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (cloned) ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກທ່ານເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຍົກລະດັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Automatic assignment is intended to be added to {productname} in a future "
"version."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດມີແຜນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Staging"
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (Content Staging)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Staging is used by clients to download packages in advance, before they are "
"installed.  This allows package installation to begin as soon as it is "
"scheduled, which can reduce the amount of time required for a maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມ (Staging) ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ທັນທີຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Content Staging"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can manage content staging across your entire organization.  In the "
"{productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a list "
"of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization, and check "
"the [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` box to allow clients in this "
"organization to stage package data."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາໃນທົ່ວອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Organizations] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ອົງກອນ, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໃນອົງກອນນີ້ສາມາດຈັດກຽມຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກັດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must be logged in as the {productname} administrator to create and "
"manage organizations."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also enable staging at the command prompt by editing "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, and adding or editing these lines:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດກຽມຜ່ານທາງ command prompt ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"
msgstr ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"

#. 2018-12-10, ke: /etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date still exists. @renner confirmed some tools use it (at least, trad. client).  To be renamed in the future.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The ``stagingContentWindow`` parameter is a time value expressed in hours "
"and determines when downloading starts.  It is the number of hours before "
"the scheduled installation or update time.  In this example, content is "
"downloaded 24 hours before the installation time.  The start time for "
"download depends on the selected contact method for a system.  The assigned "
"contact method sets the time for when the next [command]``mgr_check`` is "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Next time an action is scheduled, packages are automatically downloaded, but "
"not installed.  At the scheduled time, the staged packages are installed."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ມີການກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການ, ແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເມື່ອຮອດເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຈັດກຽມໄວ້ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Content Staging"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:11
msgid "There are two parameters used to configure content staging:"
msgstr "ມີສອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is the advance time for the "
"content staging window to open, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແມ່ນເວລາລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ຊ່ວງເວລາການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາຈະເປີດ, ເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This is the number of hours before installation starts, that package "
"downloads can begin."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທີ່ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດສາມາດເລີ່ມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:14
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is the duration of the content "
"staging window, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາຂອງຊ່ວງເວລາການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ, ເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This is the amount of time clients have to stage packages before "
"installation begins."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍມີເພື່ອຈັດກຽມແພັກເກັດກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For example, if [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is set to six "
"hours, and [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is set to two hours, "
"the staging window opens six hours before the installation time, and remain "
"open for two hours.  No packages are downloaded in the four remaining hours "
"until installation starts."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ຊ່ວງເວລາການຈັດກຽມຈະເປີດກ່ອນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ແລະ ຍັງຄົງເປີດຢູ່ເປັນເວລາ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດໃນ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງທີ່ເຫຼືອຈົນກວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you set the same value for both "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` and "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` packages are able to be "
"downloaded until installation begins."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນໃຫ້ກັບທັງ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window``, ແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆຈະສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈົນກວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Configure the content staging parameters in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:19
msgid "Default values:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:20
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:21
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:22
msgid "Content staging must be enabled for these parameters to work correctly."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (Custom Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Custom channels give you the ability to create your own software packages "
"and repositories, which you can use to update your clients.  They also allow "
"you to use software provided by third party vendors in your environment."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຜູ້ຂາຍພາຍນອກ (third party) ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section gives more detail on how to create, administer, and delete "
"custom channels.  You must have administrator privileges to be able to "
"create and manage custom channels."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງ, ບໍລິຫານ, ແລະ ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດທິຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating Custom Channels and Repositories"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you create a custom channel, determine which base channel you want to "
"associate it with, and which repositories you want to use for content."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານໃດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງນຳ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບໃດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have custom software packages that you need to install on your client "
"systems, you can create a custom child channel to manage them.  You need to "
"create the channel in the {productname} {webui} and create a repository for "
"the packages, before assigning the channel to your systems."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີແພັກເກັດຊອບແວກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການພວກມັນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃນ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄັງເກັບສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Do not create child channels containing packages that are not compatible "
"with the client system."
msgstr "ຢ່າສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can select a vendor channel as the base channel if you want to use "
"packages provided by a vendor.  Alternatively, select ``none`` to make your "
"custom channel a base channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຂາຍເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຜູ້ຂາຍສະໜອງໃຫ້. ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``none`` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Software Channel`` page, give your channel a name "
"(for example, [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) and a label (for "
"example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Software Channel``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) ແລະ ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:12
msgid "Labels must not contain spaces or uppercase letters."
msgstr "ປ້າຍຊື່ (Labels) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent Channel`` drop down, choose the relevant base "
"channel (for example, [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for "
"x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Parent Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:14
msgid "Ensure that you choose the compatible parent channel for your packages."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Architecture`` drop down, choose the appropriate hardware "
"architecture (for example, [systemitem]``x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Architecture``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Provide any additional information in the contact details, channel access "
"control, and GPG fields, as required for your environment."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນລາຍລະອຽດການຕິດຕໍ່, ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ຟີວ GPG ຕາມທີ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Channel]."

#.  We need to create a section on importing GPG keys and change this to point there: https://github.com/SUSE/spacewalk/issues/9474 LKB 2019-09-18
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Custom channels sometimes require additional security settings.  Many third "
"party vendors secure packages with GPG.  If you want to use GPG-protected "
"packages in your custom channel, you need to trust the GPG key which has "
"been used to sign the metadata.  You can then check the [guimenu]``Has "
"Signed Metadata?`` check box to match the package metadata against the "
"trusted GPG keys."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຜູ້ຂາຍພາຍນອກຫຼາຍລາຍປ້ອງກັນແພັກເກັດດ້ວຍ GPG. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດທີ່ປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍ GPG ໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊັນຊື່ເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata). ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບເມຕາເດຕາຂອງແພັກເກັດກັບຄີ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້."

#.  This xref is misleading:
#.  For more information on importing GPG keys, see xref:reference:systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If remote channels and repositories are signed with GPG keys, you can import "
"and trust these GPG keys.  For example, execute the "
"[command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` from the command line on the {productname} "
"Server:"
msgstr "ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບທາງໄກຖືກເຊັນດ້ວຍຄີ GPG, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ຈາກ command line ໃນ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The underlying [command]``zypper`` call will import the key, if it is "
"available.  The {webui} does not offer this feature."
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ [command]``zypper`` ຈະນຳເຂົ້າຄີ ຫາກມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. {webui} ບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This only works when the repository you want to mirror is set up in a "
"special way and provide the \"key\" in the repository next to the "
"signature.  This is the case for all repositories generated by the Open "
"Build Service (OBS).  For other repositories special preparation steps are "
"needed (see below!)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:23
msgid ""
"By default, the ``Enable GPG Check`` field is checked when you create a new "
"channel.  If you would like to add custom packages and applications to your "
"channel, make sure you uncheck this field to be able to install unsigned "
"packages.  Disabling the GPG check is a security risk if packages are from "
"an untrusted source."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຟີວ ``Enable GPG Check`` ຈະຖືກໝາຍຕິກເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕິກໃນຟີວນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ມີລາຍເຊັນໄດ້. ການປິດການກວດສອບ GPG ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫາກແພັກເກັດມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you are registering traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 or SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients "
"you might notice errors with unsigned packages.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can only add a repository to the {productname} with the {webui} if it is "
"a valid software repository.  Check in advance that needed repository "
"metadata are available.  Tools such as [command]``createrepo`` and "
"[command]``reprepro`` are useful in this regard.  [command]``mgrpush`` can "
"help with pushing a single RPM into a channel without creating a "
"repository.  For more information, see the man pages for "
"[literal]``createrepo_c`` and [literal]``reprepro``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບລ່ວງໜ້າວ່າເມຕາເດຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈຳເປັນນັ້ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ [command]``createrepo`` ແລະ [command]``reprepro`` ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສ່ວນນີ້. [command]``mgrpush`` ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການດັນ (push) RPM ດຽວເຂົ້າໄປໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງຄັງເກັບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໜ້າ man ສຳລັບ [literal]``createrepo_c`` ແລະ [literal]``reprepro``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Software Repository"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories], and click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Repositories], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:28
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Repository`` page, give your repository a label "
"(for example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Repository``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃຫ້ກັບຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Repository URL`` field, provide the path to the directory "
"that contains the [path]``repodata`` file (for example, "
"[systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``).  You can use any valid addressing "
"protocol in this field."
msgstr "ໃນຟີວ [guimenu]``Repository URL``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [path]``repodata`` (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນຟີວນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:30
msgid "Uncheck the [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` check box."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕິກໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Complete the SSL fields if your repository requires client "
"certificate authentication."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຟີວ SSL ຫາກຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:32
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The above procedure only works if the repository you want to mirror provides "
"the \"key\" in the repository next to the signature.  This is the case for "
"all repositories generated by the OBS, but it is typically not the case for "
"other repos of operating systems that are not offered by the OBS."
msgstr ""

#.  Not sure how it is possible to import the key into the RPM DB which is used for syncing.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:34
msgid ""
"If the repository you want to use does not have a GPG key you can provide "
"one yourself and import the GPG key into the keyring manually.  If you "
"import the key into the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir`` keyring using "
"the [command]``gpg`` commandline tool it would be stored permanently.  The "
"key would also persist if the chroot environment would be cleaned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Software Repository with GPG Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວດ້ວຍຄີ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:36
msgid "The gpg command to import a key into the pub keyring is:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --import /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr ""

#.  Using gpg is horrible. You need to find out the keyid, you need to trust "ultimately" and save the change.
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Add Debian non-flat repositories using ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, "
"and ``uyuni_arch`` query parameters."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ Debian ແບບ non-flat ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, ແລະ ``uyuni_arch``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_suite``"
msgstr "``uyuni_suite``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"is mandatory.  In Debian documentation, this is also known as "
"[literal]``distribution``.  With this parameter you specify the apt source.  "
"Without this parameter the original approach is used.  If the parameter ends "
"with ``/``, the repository is identified as flat."
msgstr "ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ. ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Debian, ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຊື່ [literal]``distribution``. ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ ທ່ານຈະລະບຸແຫຼ່ງ apt. ຫາກບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ ວິທີການເດີມຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ຫາກພາລາມິເຕີລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ ``/``, ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກລະບຸວ່າເປັນແບບ flat."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_component``"
msgstr "``uyuni_component``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:42
msgid ""
"is optional.  This parameter can specify only one component.  It is not "
"possible to list the components.  An apt source entry allows to specify "
"multiple components, but for Uyuni it is not possible.  Instead you must "
"create separate repository for each component."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_arch``"
msgstr "``uyuni_arch``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:44
msgid ""
"is optional.  If omitted the architecture name is calculated with a SQL "
"query for the channel from the database.  Specify ``uyuni_arch`` explicitly "
"if it does not match the architecture of the channel (sometimes architecture "
"naming is ambiguous)."
msgstr "ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກລະເວັ້ນໄວ້ ຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຈະຖືກຄຳນວນດ້ວຍ SQL query ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ລະບຸ ``uyuni_arch`` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ (ບາງຄັ້ງການຕັ້ງຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອາດມີຄວາມກຳກວມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:45
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian non-flat repository mapping"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ Debian ແບບ non-flat"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type             | Source line / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable "
"main``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ປະເພດ             | ແຖວແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ / URL\n"
"| ແຖວແຫຼ່ງ apt  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| ການຈັບຄູ່ URL      | ``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| ແຖວແຫຼ່ງ apt  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main``\n"
"| ການຈັບຄູ່ URL      | ``https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Find here background information about the Debian repository definition "
"format.  This information is based on "
"https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:49
msgid "The repository definition format is as follows:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"
msgstr "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"
msgstr "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:53
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"
msgstr "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:55
msgid ""
"For each pair of ``suite`` and ``component`` the spezification defines a "
"distinct URL calculated on the base URL ``+ suite + component``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄູ່ຂອງ ``suite`` ແລະ ``component``, ການກຳນົດຈະລະບຸ URL ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເຊິ່ງຄຳນວນຈາກ URL ພື້ນຖານ ``+ suite + component``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the Repository to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Assign your new repository to your custom channel by navigating to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels], clicking the name of your newly created "
"custom channel, and navigating to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Ensure the repository you want to assign to the channel is checked, and "
"click btn:[Update Repositories]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab and click btn:[Sync Now] to "
"synchronize immediately. For more information about channel synchronization, "
"see below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Custom Channels to an Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:61
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"select the key you want to add the custom channel to."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys], ແລະ ເລືອກຄີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the [guiemnu]``Details`` tab, in the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` listing, "
"select the channel to associate."
msgstr "ໃນແຖບ [guiemnu]``Details``, ໃນລາຍຊື່ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:63
msgid "You can select multiple channels, if you need to."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:64
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom channel synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To avoid missing important updates, {suse} recommends to keep your custom "
"channels up to date with the remote repositories changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການພາດການອັບເດດທີ່ສຳຄັນ, {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີກັບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄັງເກັບທາງໄກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:67
msgid ""
"By default, custom channels are not synchronized automatically. In order to "
"keep a custom channel up to date, you need to:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:68
msgid ""
"synchronize it manually by navigating to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab and click "
"btn:[Sync Now],"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Sync`` ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Sync Now],"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:69
msgid ""
"set up an automated synchronization schedule from the "
"[guimenu]``Repositories`` tab."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາຕະລາງການຊິງໂຄໄນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກແຖບ [guimenu]``Repositories``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:70
msgid ""
"It is also possible to enable automatic synchronization for all the custom "
"channels you create. To do this, set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:72
msgid "With this property turned on, a synchronization will happen automatically:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:73
msgid ""
"after adding a repository to a channel from the UI or by using "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງຈາກ UI ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:74
msgid ""
"as part of the daily task ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, which will "
"synchronize all your custom and vendor channels."
msgstr "ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງວຽກປະຈຳວັນ ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, ເຊິ່ງຈະຊິງໂຄໄນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຂາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When the process is started, there are several ways to check if a channel "
"has finished synchronizing:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການຊິງໂຄໄນສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:76
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ເລືອກແຖບ [guimenu]``Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:77
msgid ""
"This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກ (dialog) ນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນກຳລັງຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນກົດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ repository ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:[Repositories > Sync] tab.  The [guimenu]``Sync "
"Status`` is shown next to the repository name.."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:80
msgid "Check the synchronization log file at the command prompt:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ລັອກ (log file) ການຊິງໂຄໄນທີ່ command prompt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be "
"sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະສ້າງລັອກຂອງຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຊິງໂຄໄນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ລັອກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊິງໂຄໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Packages and Patches to Custom Channels"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດ ແລະ Patches ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:84
msgid ""
"When you create a new custom channel without cloning it from an existing "
"channel, it does not contain any packages or patches.  You can add the "
"packages and patches you require using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ໂຄລນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່, ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື patches ໃດໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດ ແລະ patches ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Custom channels can only include packages or patches that are cloned or "
"custom, and they must match the base architecture of the channel.  Patches "
"added to custom channels must apply to a package that exists in the channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງສາມາດລວມເອົາໄດ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື patches ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ຫຼື ກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ພວກມັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳພື້ນຖານຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ. patches ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Packages to Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Packages`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Packages``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:88
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all packages currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໃນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:89
msgid "Add new packages to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Add``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide packages, and click btn:[View Packages] "
"to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[View Packages] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Check the packages to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Add "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:92
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm Addition] to "
"add the packages to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm Addition] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:93
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can compare the packages in the current channel with those in "
"a different channel by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and "
"going to the menu:Packages[Compare] tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງປັດຈຸບັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Packages[Compare]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:94
msgid ""
"To make the two channels the same, click the btn:[Merge Differences] button, "
"and resolve any conflicts."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສອງຊ່ອງທາງຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Merge Differences], ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃດໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Patches to a Custom Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Patches ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:96
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Patches`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Patches``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:97
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all patches currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງ patches ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໃນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:98
msgid ""
"Add new patches to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab, "
"and selecting what kind of patches you want to add."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ patches ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Add``, ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງ patches ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:99
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide patches, and click btn:[View Associated "
"Patches] to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະສະໜອງ patches, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[View Associated Patches] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:100
msgid "Check the patches to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກ patches ທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm] to add the "
"patches to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ patches ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:103
msgid ""
"{productname} administrators and channel administrators can alter or delete "
"any channel."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:104
msgid ""
"To grant other users rights to alter or delete a channel, navigate to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to edit.  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Managers`` tab, and check the user to grant "
"permissions.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບສິດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໃນການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels] ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ. ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Managers``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຈະມອບສິດໃຫ້. ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:105
msgid ""
"If you delete a channel that has been assigned to a set of clients, it "
"triggers an immediate update of the channel state for any clients associated "
"with the deleted channel.  This is to ensure that the changes are reflected "
"accurately in the repository file."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍ, ມັນຈະກະຕຸ້ນການອັບເດດສະຖານະຊ່ອງທາງທັນທີສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:106
msgid ""
"You cannot delete {productname} channels with the {webui}.  Only custom "
"channels can be deleted."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:108
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and select the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:109
msgid "Click btn:[Delete software channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete software channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:110
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Delete Channel`` page, check the details of the channel "
"you are deleting, and check the [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` checkbox to "
"remove the custom channel from any systems that might still be subscribed."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Delete Channel``, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງລຶບ, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` ເພື່ອຖອນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກລະບົບໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ອາດຈະຍັງສະໝັກໃຊ້ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:111
msgid "Click btn:[Delete Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:112
msgid ""
"When channels are deleted, the packages that are part of the deleted channel "
"are not automatically removed.  You are not able to update packages that "
"have had their channel deleted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກລຶບ, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖອນອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງພວກມັນຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:113
msgid ""
"You can delete packages that are not associated with a channel in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Packages], check "
"the packages to remove, and click btn:[Delete Packages]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໆໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Packages], ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຖອນອອກ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnected Setup)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to connect {productname} to the internet, you can "
"use it within a disconnected environment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} ກັບອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The repository mirroring tool (RMT) is available on {sle}{nbsp}15 and "
"later.  RMT replaces the subscription management tool (SMT), which can be "
"used on older {sle} installations."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Repository Mirroring Tool (RMT) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {sle}{nbsp}15 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. RMT ມາແທນທີ່ Subscription Management Tool (SMT), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In a disconnected {productname} setup, RMT or SMT uses an external network "
"to connect to {scc}.  All software channels and repositories are "
"synchronized to a removable storage device.  The storage device can then be "
"used to update the disconnected {productname} installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This setup allows your {productname} installation to remain in an offline, "
"disconnected environment."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບອອບລາຍ ແລະ ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Your RMT or SMT instance must be used to manage the {productname} Server "
"directly.  It cannot be used to manage a second RMT or SMT instance, in a "
"cascade."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ {productname} Server ໂດຍກົງ. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ອັນທີສອງໃນຮູບແບບ cascade ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on RMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-rmt.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize RMT"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can use RMT on {sle} 15 installations to manage clients running {sle} 12 "
"or later."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} 15 ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"We recommend you set up a dedicated RMT instance for each {productname} "
"installation."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up RMT"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:12
msgid "On the RMT instance, install the RMT package:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ RMT:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rmt-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in rmt-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:14
msgid "Configure RMT using {yast}:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 rmt\n"
msgstr "yast2 rmt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:16
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete installation."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information on setting up RMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-rmt.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing RMT with SCC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the RMT instance, list all available products and repositories for your "
"organization:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບທີ່ມີທັງໝົດສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:21
msgid "Synchronize all available updates for your organization:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນການອັບເດດທີ່ມີທັງໝົດສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli sync\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:23
msgid "You can also configure RMT to synchronize regularly using systemd."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີໂດຍໃຊ້ systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Enable the products you require."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:25
msgid "For example, to enable SLES 15:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SLES 15:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:40
msgid "Export the synchronized data to your removable storage."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊິງໂຄໄນແລ້ວໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:28
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:41
msgid "In this example, the storage medium is mounted at [path]``/mnt/usb``:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເມົາ (mount) ໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/mnt/usb``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:30
msgid "Export the enabled repositories to your removable storage:"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change RMT user settings in the `cli` section of "
"[path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ `cli` ຂອງ [path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize SMT"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນ SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:34
msgid ""
"SMT is included with {sle} 12, and can be used to manage clients running "
"{sle} 10 or later."
msgstr "SMT ມີມາພ້ອມກັບ {sle} 12, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 10 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"SMT requires you to create a local mirror directory on the SMT instance to "
"synchronize repositories and packages."
msgstr "SMT ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເມີເມີ (mirror directory) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄໄນຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more details on installing and configuring SMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ SMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing SMT with SCC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:38
msgid "On the SMT instance, create a database replacement file:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທົດແທນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"
msgstr "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/suma/product_tree.json -o "
"/mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"
msgstr ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/suma/product_tree.json -o /mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change SMT user settings in "
"[path]``/etc/smt.conf``."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ SMT ໄດ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/smt.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The corresponding {productname} Client Tools Channels are required, for "
"{productname} to be able to synchronize a given channel.  If these channels "
"are not enabled, {productname} may fail to detect that product."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Client Tools ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດຊິງໂຄໄນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໄດ້. ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, {productname} ອາດຈະກວດບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Run the following command to enable these mandatory channels:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 12 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 12 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ມັນ ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:48
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:49
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 15 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 15 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ມັນ ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:51
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:52
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Then mirror the channels, and export."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດເມີເມີຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Other distributions, or architectures, can be enabled.  For more information "
"about enabling product channels or repositories to be mirrored, see the "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈກຈ່າຍ ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອື່ນໆໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈະເຮັດເມີເມີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "RMT"
msgstr "RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:56
