#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:233
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image using the {webui}.  Either select "
"menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the menu:Images[Profiles] "
"list."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:237
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກ (tag name) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``latest`` (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:238
msgid "Select the [guimenu]``Image Profile`` and a [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Image Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:239
msgid ""
"A [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` is displayed to the right of the build "
"fields.  When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about "
"the selected profile is shown here."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Profile Summary`` ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້ເລືອກ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສ້າງແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:240
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາການສ້າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:241
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີການສ້າງບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automounter) ຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການສ້າງອິເມຈ. ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Gnome session ໃນຖານະ root. ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ automounter, ການສ້າງອິເມຈຈະສຳເລັດ ແຕ່ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງອິເມຈຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:242
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງອິເມຈສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບ {susemgr} ຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:243
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:244
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum ຂອງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:245
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງອິເມຈ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:246
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "ຫາກປະເພດອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແມ່ນ `PXE`, {salt} pillar ກໍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳ. Image pillars ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະບົບຍ່ອຍຂອງ {salt} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈຖືກເກັບໄວ້, ຄ່າ checksum, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:247
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບທຸກ clients ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:248
msgid ""
"When building KIWI images with network boot (PXE) enabled (for example, "
"using `installpxe=\"true\"` and `installiso=\"true\"` in the KIWI profile), "
"the netboot artifacts might not be collected and uploaded to the server by "
"default.  To ensure that all bundle artifacts (including `.install.tar` "
"containing the PXE files, and `.raw.xz`) are uploaded to the {productname} "
"server, you must define the `use_bundle_build` custom info key on the build "
"host."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:249
msgid "To configure this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:250
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Custom System Info] in the {webui} and create a "
"custom system info key named `use_bundle_build`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
msgid ""
"Assign the `use_bundle_build` key with a value of `true` on the designated "
"OS Image Build Host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:253
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "ການສ້າງອິເມຈຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ. ເມື່ອການສ້າງຜິດພາດ, ການກວດສອບຜົນຂອງ {salt} states ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ (build log) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການກວດສອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອການສ້າງຜິດພາດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:254
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "Build host ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:255
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ພຽງພໍສຳລັບອິເມຈ ທັງໃນ build host ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:256
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "ລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ມີຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:257
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ທີ່ `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບປຸງໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະ RPM, ເບິ່ງ <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:260
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:261
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ HTTPS ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ HTTP ຫຼື ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ git ຄວນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ custom state, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈທີ່ອີງຕາມ Kiwi."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "ລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Image List]. ລາຍການອິເມຈທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_list_images.png"
msgstr "images_list_images.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image [guimenu]``Name``, its "
"[guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, and the build "
"[guimenu]``Status``.  You can also see the image update status with a "
"listing of possible patch and package updates that are available for the "
"image."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈປະກອບມີ [guimenu]``Name`` ຂອງອິເມຈ, [guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, ແລະ [guimenu]``Status`` ຂອງການສ້າງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເບິ່ງສະຖານະການອັບເດດອິເມຈ ພ້ອມກັບລາຍການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດອັບເດດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Version`` fields "
"originate from Kiwi sources and are updated at the end of successful build.  "
"During building or after failed build these fields show a temporary name "
"based on profile name."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ OS Images, ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Version`` ແມ່ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Kiwi ແລະ ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອການສ້າງສຳເລັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງຜິດພາດ ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ອີງຕາມຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Revision`` is automatically increased after each successful "
"build. For OS Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Revision`` ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ສຳລັບ OS Images, ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍ revision ຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` checkbox."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Container Images ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈະເກັບສະເພາະ revision ລ່າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ revision ກ່ອນໜ້າ (ແພັກເກດ, ແພັດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໝາຍທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Show obsolete``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Details] ໃນອິເມຈ ຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງໆ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີລາຍການແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ລາຍການແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete] ຈະລຶບອິເມຈອອກຈາກລາຍການ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງລຶບ pillar ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ຈາກ OS Image Store ແລະ revision ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສະຖານະການກວດສອບຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure Maintenance Tasks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບຊ່ວງເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບ (downtime) ທີ່ໄດ້ວາງແຜນໄວ້, ທ່ານອາດຈະຮູ້ສຶກຍາກໃນການຈື່ທຸກຢ່າງ ທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນ, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກຊ່ວງເວລາ downtime ນັ້ນຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers ຫຼື {productname} Proxies ກໍໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນານຳ."

#.  It's similar to zypper at the package level:
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you do not keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able "
"to update some parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການກວດສອບສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາ downtime ຂອງທ່ານ, ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃນການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#.  ke, 2019-09-30: we'll stop spacewalk during the update
#.  . Stop spacewalk services.
#.  You need to stop the spacewalk, SAP, and database services, along with any others you have running.
#.  . Check if the configuration is still correct.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#.  We reboot during the above listed procedures.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເປັນ service pack ຫຼ້າສຸດ, ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#.  . Reboot the server.
#.  . Check if the configuration is still correct.
#.  . Start any stopped services.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Run [command]``spacewalk-service status`` and check whether all required "
"services are up and running."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-service status`` ແລະ ກວດສອບເບິ່ງວ່າທຸກໆບໍລິການທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແມ່ນເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information about database schema upgrades and PostgreSQL migrations, "
"see xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid "You can install updates using your package manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr ""

#
#
#. Preferable, you run such a tool within a maintenance window; for more information, see xref:administration:maintenance-window.adoc#maintenance-window[].
#. complete procedure, also see above:
#. 1. Log in as root user to the SUSE Manager server.
#. 2. Stop the Spacewalk service:
#.    spacewalk-service stop
#. 3. Apply the patch using either zypper patch or YaST Online Update.
#. 4. Upgrade the database schema:
#.     spacewalk-schema-upgrade
#. 5. Start the Spacewalk service:
#.     spacewalk-service start
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດ (update channels) ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ສຳລັບ ເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scc} or use "
"{rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:19
msgid "The output looks similar to this:"
msgstr "ຜົນທີ່ສະແດງຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                                                   | Enabled | GPG Check "
"| Refresh\n"
"-------------------------------------------------------+---------+-----------+--------\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP2-Pool                       | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP2-Updates                    | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Python2-15-SP2-Pool                         | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Python2-15-SP2-Updates                      | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Pool               | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Updates            | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Pool                | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Updates             | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-SP2-Pool              | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-SP2-Updates           | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP2-Pool                    | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP2-Updates                 | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{productname} releases maintenance updates (MUs) to provide newer packages.  "
"Maintenance updates are indicated with a new version number.  For example, "
"the major release 4.1 is incremented to 4.1.1 when an MU is released."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can verify which version you are running by looking at the bottom of the "
"navigation bar in the {webui}.  You can also fetch the version number with "
"the [literal]``api.getVersion()`` XMLRPC API call."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍການເບິ່ງທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບນຳທາງໃນ {webui}. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດຶງໝາຍເລກເວີຊັນດ້ວຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [literal]``api.getVersion()`` XMLRPC API."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືໄຄເອັນ (Client Tools)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When the server is updated consider updating some tools on the clients, "
"too.  Updating [package]``salt-minion``, [package]``zypper``, and other "
"related management package on clients is not a strict requirement, but it is "
"a best practice in general.  For example, a maintenance update on the server "
"might introduce a major new Salt version.  Then Salt clients continue to "
"work but might experience problems later on.  To avoid this always update "
"the [package]``salt-minion`` package when available.  {suse} makes sure that "
"[package]``salt-minion`` can always be updated safely."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຊີເວີຖືກອັບເດດແລ້ວ ຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດເຄື່ອງມືບາງຢ່າງໃນ clients ນຳ. ການອັບເດດ [package]``salt-minion``, [package]``zypper``, ແລະ ແພັກເກດການຈັດການອື່ນໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃນ clients ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ, ແຕ່ເປັນການປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃນເຊີເວີອາດຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ Salt ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຫຼັກ. ຈາກນັ້ນ Salt clients ຈະຍັງຄົງ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ແຕ່ອາດຈະພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້ ໃຫ້ອັບເດດແພັກເກດ [package]``salt-minion`` ສະເໝີເມື່ອມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. {suse} ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ [package]``salt-minion`` ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພສະເໝີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If you are using an inter-server synchronization slave server, update it "
"after the {productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more in inter-server synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:iss.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If you are using a monitoring server for Prometheus, update it after the "
"{productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມສຳລັບ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດມັນຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ ເຊີເວີ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຝົ້າລະວັງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Proxies should be updated as soon as {productname} Server updates are "
"complete."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດທັນທີທີ່ການອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname} ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In general, running a proxy connected to a server on a different version is "
"not supported.  The only exception is for the duration of updates where it "
"is expected that the server is updated first, so the proxy could run the "
"previous version temporarily."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີຄົນລະເວີຊັນ. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນດຽວແມ່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດ ເຊິ່ງຄາດວ່າເຊີເວີຈະຖືກອັບເດດກ່ອນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພຣັອກຊີຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Especially if you are migrating from version 4.0 to 4.1, upgrade the server "
"first, then any proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:35
msgid "For more information, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization - Version 1"
msgstr "Inter-Server Synchronization - ເວີຊັນ 1"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have more than one {productname} installation, you need to ensure "
"that they stay aligned on content and permissions.  Inter-Server "
"Synchronization (ISS) allows you to connect two or more {productname} "
"Servers and keep them up-to-date."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງບ່ອນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ ແມ່ນຕົງກັນ. Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີ {productname} ສອງບ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນເປັນປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To set up ISS version 1, you need to define one {productname} Server as a "
"master, with the other as a slave.  If conflicting configurations exist, the "
"system prioritizes the master configuration."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS ເວີຊັນ 1, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດເຊີເວີ {productname} ບ່ອນໜຶ່ງເປັນ master, ແລະ ບ່ອນອື່ນໆເປັນ slave. ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ລະບົບຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ master."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:4
msgid ""
"ISS Masters are masters only because they have slaves attached to them.  "
"This means that you need to set up the ISS Master first, by defining its "
"slaves.  You can then set up the ISS Slaves, by attaching them to a master."
msgstr "ISS Masters ຈະເປັນ master ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີ slave ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ນຳ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Master ກ່ອນ ໂດຍການກຳນົດ slaves ຂອງມັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Slaves ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພວກມັນກັບ master."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up an ISS Master"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[ISS Configuration > "
"Master Setup], and click btn:[Add new slave]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[ISS Configuration > Master Setup], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Add new slave]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Edit Slave Details`` dialog, provide these details for the "
"ISS Master's first slave:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Edit Slave Details``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ slave ທຳອິດຂອງ ISS Master:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Slave Fully Qualified Domain Name`` field, enter the FQDN "
"of the ISS Slave."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Slave Fully Qualified Domain Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ FQDN ຂອງ ISS Slave."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:9
msgid "For example: [systemitem]``server2.example.com``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``server2.example.com``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Allow Slave to Sync?`` checkbox to enable the slave to "
"synchronize with the master."
msgstr "ໝາຍທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Allow Slave to Sync?`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ slave ສາມາດ synchronize ກັບ master ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Sync All Orgs to Slave?`` checkbox to synchronize all "
"organizations to this slave."
msgstr "ໝາຍທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Sync All Orgs to Slave?`` ເພື່ອ synchronize ທຸກອົງກອນ ໄປຍັງ slave ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to add the ISS slave."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ISS slave."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Allow Export of the Selected Organizations`` section, "
"check the organizations you want to allow this slave to export to the "
"master, and click btn:[Allow Orgs]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Allow Export of the Selected Organizations``, ໝາຍເລືອກອົງກອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ slave ບ່ອນນີ້ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງ master, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Allow Orgs]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Before you set up the ISS Slave, you need to ensure you have the appropriate "
"CA certificate."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Slave, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານມີໃບຮັບຮອງ CA ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Copying the Master CA Certificate to an ISS Slave"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກັອບປີ້ໃບຮັບຮອງ Master CA ໄປຍັງ ISS Slave"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, locate the CA Certificate at "
"``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` and create a copy that can "
"be transferred to the ISS Slave."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ ISS Master, ຊອກຫາໃບຮັບຮອງ CA ຢູ່ທີ່ ``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` ແລະ ສ້າງສຳເນົາເພື່ອໂອນໄປຍັງ ISS Slave."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the ISS Slave, save the CA certificate file to the "
"``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`` directory."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ ISS Slave, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ໃບຮັບຮອງ CA ໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:18
msgid "When you have copied the certificate, you can set up the ISS Slave."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກັອບປີ້ໃບຮັບຮອງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Slave ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up an ISS Slave"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS Slave"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[ISS Configuration > "
"Slave Setup], and click btn:[Add new master]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[ISS Configuration > Slave Setup], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Add new master]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Details for new Master`` dialog, provide these details for "
"the server to use as the ISS master:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Details for new Master``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ ເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນ ISS master:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Master Fully Qualified Domain Name`` field, enter the FQDN "
"of the ISS Master for this slave."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Master Fully Qualified Domain Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ FQDN ຂອງ ISS Master ສຳລັບ slave ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:23
msgid "For example: ``server1.example.com``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``server1.example.com``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename of this Master's CA Certificate`` field, enter "
"the absolute path to the CA certificate on the ISS master."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filename of this Master's CA Certificate``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ path ຂອງໃບຮັບຮອງ CA ໃນ ISS master."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:25
msgid "This should be ``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT``."
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນ ``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add new master] to add the ISS Slave to this master."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Add new master] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ISS Slave ໃຫ້ກັບ master ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Completing ISS Setup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ISS ສຳເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:28
msgid "At the command prompt on the ISS Slave, synchronize with the ISS Master:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ ISS Slave, ໃຫ້ synchronize ກັບ ISS Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-inter-sync\n"
msgstr "mgr-inter-sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: To synchronize a single channel, use this command:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພື່ອ synchronize ພຽງຊ່ອງທາງດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-inter-sync -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "mgr-inter-sync -c <ຊື່-ຊ່ອງທາງ>\n"

#.  Need to double check this against the UI. --LKB 2020-04-08
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[ISS Configuration > "
"Configure Master-to-Slave Mappings] and select the organizations you want to "
"synchronize."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[ISS Configuration > Configure Master-to-Slave Mappings] ແລະ ເລືອກອົງກອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ synchronize."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "Inter-Server Synchronization"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_intro.adoc:2
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have more than one {productname} installation, you will need to copy "
"contents between servers.  Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS) allows you to "
"export data from one server (source) and import it on another (target) "
"server.  This is useful for hub deployment scenarios or disconnected setups."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງບ່ອນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ. Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ຕົ້ນທາງ) ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄປຫາອີກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ປາຍທາງ). ນີ້ເປັນປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ hub ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"With the version 2 ISS implementation {suse} removed the master/slave "
"notion.  Contents can be exported and imported in any direction between any "
"{productname} server."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ ISS ເວີຊັນ 2, {suse} ໄດ້ຍົກເລີກແນວຄິດ master/slave ອອກໄປ. ເນື້ອຫາສາມາດສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໃນທິດທາງໃດກໍໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃດກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization - Version 2"
msgstr "Inter-Server Synchronization - ເວີຊັນ 2"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:3
msgid ""
"With the version 2 ISS implementation {suse} removed the master/slave "
"notion.  Contents can be exported and imported in any direction between any "
"{productname} server."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ ISS ເວີຊັນ 2, {suse} ໄດ້ຍົກເລີກແນວຄິດ master/slave ອອກໄປ. ເນື້ອຫາສາມາດສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໃນທິດທາງໃດກໍໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃດກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install ISS Packages"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ISS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To use ISS you need to install the [package]``inter-server-sync`` package on "
"source and target servers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Synchronization"
msgstr "ການ Synchronize ເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Export data on source server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຊີເວີຕົ້ນທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the source server, on the command line execute the ISS export command.  "
"The [option]``-h`` option provides detailed help:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "inter-server-sync export -h\n"
msgstr "inter-server-sync export -h\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The export procedure creates an output directory with all the needed data "
"for the import procedure."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການສົ່ງອອກຈະສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂາອອກພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Copy export directory to target server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກັອບປີ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Contents from the source server needs to be synchronized to the target "
"server.  On the command line, as root, execute:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rsync -r <PATH_EXPORTED_DIR> root@<TARGET_SERVER>:~/\n"
msgstr "rsync -r <PATH_EXPORTED_DIR> root@<TARGET_SERVER>:~/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:14
msgid "When all contents is copied, start importing it."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຖືກກັອບປີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import data on target server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the target server, on the command line execute the ISS import command.  "
"The [option]``-h`` option provides detailed help:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "inter-server-sync import -h\n"
msgstr "inter-server-sync import -h\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database connection configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Database connection configuration is loaded by default from "
"``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  Properties file location can be overridden with "
"parameter ``--serverConfig``."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ Properties ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ ``--serverConfig``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Known Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:21
msgid "Source and target servers need to be on the same version."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ປາຍທາງຕ້ອງເປັນເວີຊັນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Export and import organization should have exactly the same name.  The "
"organization name is case sensitive."
msgstr "ອົງກອນທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ ຄວນມີຊື່ຄືກັນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຊື່ຂອງອົງກອນແມ່ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ ຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ (case sensitive)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Channels for Live Patching"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງສຳລັບ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A reboot is required every time you update the full kernel package.  "
"Therefore, it is important that clients using Live Patching do not have "
"newer kernels available in the channels they are assigned to.  Clients using "
"live patching have updates for the running kernel in the live patching "
"channels."
msgstr "ການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານອັບເດດແພັກເກດ kernel ຕົວເຕັມ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ Live Patching ບໍ່ຄວນມີ kernel ທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ພວກເຂົາຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້. clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ live patching ຈະມີການອັບເດດ ສຳລັບ kernel ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:3
msgid "There are two ways to manage channels for live patching:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງສຳລັບ live patching:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Use content lifecycle management to clone the product tree and remove kernel "
"versions newer than the running one.  This procedure is explained in the "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[].  "
"This is the recommended solution."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (content lifecycle management) ເພື່ອກັອບປີ້ (clone) ຕົ້ນໄມ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ລຶບ kernel ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າຕົວທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ ໄດ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[]. ນີ້ຄືວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use the `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle` tool.  This "
"procedure is more manual and requires command line tools as well as the "
"{webui}.  This procedure is explained in this section for SLES{nbsp}15 SP5, "
"but it also works for SLE{nbsp}12 SP4 or later."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງຄືການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle`. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ ເປັນການເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື command line ພ້ອມກັບ {webui}. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສຳລັບ SLES 15 SP5, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ SLE 12 SP4 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle for Live Patching"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle ສຳລັບ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Cloned vendor channels should be prefixed by ``dev`` for development, "
"``testing``, or ``prod`` for production.  In this procedure, you create a "
"``dev`` cloned channel and then promote the channel to ``testing``."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ vendor ທີ່ຖືກ clone ຄວນມີຄຳນຳໜ້າວ່າ ``dev`` ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ, ``testing``, ຫຼື ``prod`` ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ clone ແບບ ``dev`` ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງປ່ຽນລະດັບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນ ``testing``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Cloning Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການ Clone ຊ່ອງທາງ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as root, obtain the current package "
"channel tree:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ client, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລຳດັບຊ່ອງທາງແພັກເກດປັດຈຸບັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``spacewalk-manage-channel`` command with the "
"[option]``init`` argument to automatically create a new development clone of "
"the original vendor channel:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-manage-channel`` ພ້ອມກັບອາຣ໌ກິວເມນ [option]``init`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ clone ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ vendor ດັ້ງເດີມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Check that [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`` is available "
"in your channel list."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ ໃນລາຍການຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Check the ``dev`` cloned channel you created, and remove any kernel updates "
"that require a reboot."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຊ່ອງທາງ clone ແບບ ``dev`` ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ລຶບການອັບເດດ kernel ໃດໆ ທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing Non-Live Kernel Patches from Cloned Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບ Kernel Patches ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Live ອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ Clone ໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Check the current kernel version by selecting the client from "
"menu:Systems[System List], and taking note of the version displayed in the "
"[guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ກວດສອບເວີຊັນ kernel ປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[System List], ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກເວີຊັນທີ່ສະແດງໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"navigate to the menu:Software[Manage > Channels] tab, and select "
"[systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[Overview], ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກ [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Patches`` tab, and click btn:[List/Remove "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Patches``, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[List/Remove Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the search bar, type [systemitem]``kernel`` and identify the kernel "
"version that matches the kernel currently used by your client."
msgstr "ໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel`` ແລະ ລະບຸເວີຊັນ kernel ທີ່ຕົງກັບ kernel ທີ່ client ຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Remove all kernel versions that are newer than the currently installed "
"kernel."
msgstr "ລຶບ kernel ທຸກເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Your channel is now set up for live patching, and can be promoted to "
"``testing``.  In this procedure, you also add the live patching child "
"channels to your client, ready to be applied."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ live patching ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ສາມາດປ່ຽນລະດັບເປັນ ``testing``. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງຈະໄດ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channels) ຂອງ live patching ໃຫ້ກັບ client ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອພ້ອມໃນການນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນລະດັບຊ່ອງທາງ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:24
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as `root`, promote and clone the "
"`dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` channel to a new ``testing`` channel:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ client, ໃນຖານະ `root`, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະດັບ ແລະ clone ຊ່ອງທາງ `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` ໄປເປັນຊ່ອງທາງ ``testing`` ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c "
"dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"and navigate to the menu:Software[Software Channels] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Software[Software Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Check the new [systemitem]``test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64`` custom "
"channel to change the base channel, and check both corresponding live "
"patching child channels."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຊ່ອງທາງ custom [systemitem]``test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64`` ໃໝ່ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel), ແລະ ກວດສອບທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ live patching ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], confirm that the details are correct, and click "
"btn:[Confirm] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Next], ຢືນຢັນວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You can now select and view available CVE patches, and apply these important "
"kernel updates with Live Patching."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກ ແລະ ເບິ່ງແພັດ CVE ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດ kernel ທີ່ສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍ Live Patching."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}12"
msgstr "Live Patching ໃນ SLES 12"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}12 systems, live patching is managed by kGraft.  For in depth "
"information covering kGraft use, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບ SLES 12, live patching ຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ kGraft. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດ ກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ kGraft, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:3
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:4
msgid "{productname} is fully updated."
msgstr "{productname} ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຢ່າງສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}12 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີ Salt clients ໜຶ່ງບ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ SLES 12 (SP1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}12 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "Salt clients ທີ່ເປັນ SLES 12 ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}12 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ SLES 12 ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:8
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:8
msgid "The clients are fully synchronized."
msgstr "clients ໄດ້ຮັບການ synchronize ຢ່າງສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:9
msgid "Assign the clients to the cloned channels prepared for live patching."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ clients ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ clone ໄວ້ສຳລັບ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on preparation, see "
"xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຽມພ້ອມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:11
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up for Live Patching"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and on the system details page navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install] tab."
msgstr "ເລືອກ client ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the [systemitem]``kgraft`` package, and install it."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``kgraft``, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:15
msgid "Apply the highstate to enable Live Patching, and reboot the client."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Live Patching, ແລະ ບູດ client ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:16
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:16
msgid "Repeat for each client that you want to manage with Live Patching."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ client ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that [systemitem]``Live "
"Patching`` appears in the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າ live patching ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[System List], ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [systemitem]``Live Patching`` ປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:18
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Live Patches to a Kernel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ Live Patches ກັບ Kernel"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:19
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:19
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:20
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:20
msgid ""
"A banner at the top of the screen shows the number of critical and "
"non-critical packages available for the client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:21
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "live_patching_criticalupdates.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:22
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Critical] to see a list of the available critical patches."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Critical] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການແພັດທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Select any patch with a synopsis reading [guimenu]``Important: Security "
"update for the Linux kernel``."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍວ່າ [guimenu]``Important: Security update for the Linux kernel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:24
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:24
msgid "Security bugs also include their CVE number, where applicable."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພຈະລວມມີໝາຍເລກ CVE ນຳ, ຫາກມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:25
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:25
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you know the CVE number of a patch you want to apply, you can "
"search for it in menu:Audit[CVE Audit], and apply the patch to any clients "
"that require it."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫາກທ່ານຮູ້ໝາຍເລກ CVE ຂອງແພັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ ໃນເມນູ: Audit[CVE Audit], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ແພັດນັ້ນກັບ client ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:26
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Not all kernel patches are Live Patches.  Non-Live kernel patches are "
"represented by a `Reboot Required` icon located next to the `Security` "
"shield icon.  These patches always require a reboot."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆ kernel patches ຈະເປັນ Live Patches. ແພັດ kernel ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Live ຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ `Reboot Required` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໄອຄອນຮູບໄສ້ `Security`. ແພັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:27
msgid "Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Some security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"require a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}15"
msgstr "Live Patching ໃນ SLES 15"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}15 systems and newer, live patching is managed by the "
"[systemitem]``klp livepatch`` tool."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບ SLES 15 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, live patching ຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍເຄື່ອງມື [systemitem]``klp livepatch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}15 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີ Salt clients ໜຶ່ງບ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ SLES 15 (SP1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}15 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "Salt clients ທີ່ເປັນ SLES 15 ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}15 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ SLES 15 ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and navigate to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Install] tab."
msgstr "ເລືອກ client ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the [systemitem]``kernel-livepatch`` package, and install it."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``kernel-livepatch``, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that [systemitem]``Live Patch`` "
"appears in the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າ live patching ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ client ຈາກເມນູ: Systems[System List], ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [systemitem]``Live Patch`` ປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch.  Some "
"security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"requires a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ live patch. ບາງບັນຫາ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການອັບເດດ kernel ຕົວເຕັມ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໝາຍເລກ CVE ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນ live patches. ການກວດສອບ CVE ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ກຳນົດນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching with SUSE Manager"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Performing a kernel update usually requires a system reboot.  Common "
"vulnerability and exposure (CVE) patches should be applied as soon as "
"possible, but if you cannot afford the downtime, you can use Live Patching "
"to inject these important updates and skip the need to reboot."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ kernel ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຕ້ອງມີການບູດລະບົບໃໝ່. ແພັດສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ ແລະ ການເປີດເຜີຍທົ່ວໄປ (CVE) ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຫາກທ່ານ ບໍ່ສາມາດຢຸດພັກລະບົບໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Live Patching ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດ ທີ່ສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The procedure for setting up Live Patching is slightly different for "
"SLES{nbsp}12 and SLES{nbsp}15.  Both procedures are documented in this "
"section."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Live Patching ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍລະຫວ່າງ SLES 12 ແລະ SLES 15. ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງຂັ້ນຕອນໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Windows"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance Windows)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The maintenance windows feature in {productname} allows you to schedule "
"actions to occur during a scheduled maintenance window period.  When you "
"have created your maintenance window schedule, and applied it to a client, "
"you are prevented from executing some actions outside of the specified "
"period."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ maintenance windows ໃນ {productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງເວລາ ການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານ ສ້າງກຳນົດການ maintenance window ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ client ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກ ຫ້າມບໍ່ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງນອກຊ່ວງເວລາດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows operate in a different way to system locking.  System "
"locks are switched on or off as required, while maintenance windows define "
"periods of time when actions are allowed.  Additionally, the allowed and "
"restricted actions differ.  For more information about system locks, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."
msgstr "Maintenance windows ເຮັດວຽກແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການລັອກລະບົບ (system locking). ການລັອກລະບົບຈະຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ maintenance windows ຈະກຳນົດຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ຖືກຈຳກັດກໍແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລັອກລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows require both a calendar, and a schedule.  The calendar "
"defines the date and time of your maintenance window events, including "
"recurring events, and must be in [path]``ical`` format.  The schedule uses "
"the events defined in the calendar to create the maintenance windows.  You "
"must create an [path]``ical`` file for upload, or link to an [path]``ical`` "
"file to create the calendar, before you can create the schedule."
msgstr "Maintenance windows ຕ້ອງມີທັງປະຕິທິນ (calendar) ແລະ ກຳນົດການ (schedule). ປະຕິທິນຈະກຳນົດວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາຂອງເຫດການ maintenance window, ລວມເຖິງ ເຫດການທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ [path]``ical``. ກຳນົດການຈະໃຊ້ ເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໃນປະຕິທິນເພື່ອສ້າງ maintenance windows. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ ໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດ, ຫຼື ລິ້ງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອສ້າງປະຕິທິນ, ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດສ້າງກຳນົດການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When you have created the schedule, you can assign it to clients that are "
"registered to the {productname} Server.  Clients that have a maintenance "
"schedule assigned cannot run restricted actions outside of maintenance "
"windows."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງກຳນົດການແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ ເຊີເວີ {productname}. clients ທີ່ມີກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການ ທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດນອກຊ່ວງເວລາ maintenance windows ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Some examples of restricted actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຈະປ່ຽນແປງ client ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ client ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:7
msgid "Package installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:8
msgid "Client upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:9
msgid "Product migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:10
msgid "Highstate application (for Salt clients)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  Some examples of unrestricted "
"actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການເລັກນ້ອຍທີ່ຖືວ່າປອດໄພ ແລະ ບໍ່ໜ້າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບ client. ຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:12
msgid "Package profile update"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:13
msgid "Hardware refresh"
msgstr "ການຣີເຟຣຊຮາດແວ (Hardware refresh)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:14
msgid "Subscribing to software channels"
msgstr "ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you must create an [path]``ical`` file for upload, or link "
"to an [path]``ical`` file to create the calendar.  You can create "
"[path]``ical`` files in your preferred calendaring tool, such as Microsoft "
"Outlook, Google Calendar, or KOrganizer."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດ, ຫຼື ລິ້ງ ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອສ້າງປະຕິທິນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ໃນເຄື່ອງມືປະຕິທິນທີ່ທ່ານມັກ ເຊັ່ນ Microsoft Outlook, Google Calendar, ຫຼື KOrganizer."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading a New Maintenance Calendar"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫລດປະຕິທິນບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Calendars], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Calendar Name`` section, type a name for your calendar."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Calendar Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Either provide a URL to your [path]``ical`` file, or upload the file "
"directly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະບຸ URL ຂອງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:20
msgid "Click btn:[Create Calendar] to save your calendar."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create Calendar] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Schedule"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຳນົດການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:22
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Schedules], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:23
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type a name for your schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບກຳນົດການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:24
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If your [path]``ical`` file contains events that apply to more "
"than one schedule, check [guimenu]``Multi``."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ຂອງທ່ານມີເຫດການທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງກຳນົດການ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍທີ່ [guimenu]``Multi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:25
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:49
msgid "Select the calendar to assign to this schedule."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະຕິທິນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຳນົດການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:26
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:50
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:55
msgid "Click btn:[Create Schedule] to save your schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກກຳນົດການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Schedule to a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຳນົດການໃຫ້ກັບ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client to be assigned to a schedule, locate the [guimenu]``System "
"Properties`` panel, and click btn:[Edit These Properties]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Systems List], ເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຳນົດການ, ຊອກຫາແຜງ [guimenu]``System Properties``, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Edit These Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can assign clients through the system set manager by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[System Set Manager] and using the "
"menu:Misc[Maintenance Windows] tab."
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດ clients ຜ່ານ system set manager ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager] ແລະ ໃຊ້ແທັບເມນູ: Misc[Maintenance Windows]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Edit System Details`` page, locate the "
"[guimenu]``Maintenance Schedule`` field, and select the name of the schedule "
"to be assigned."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Edit System Details``, ຊອກຫາຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Maintenance Schedule``, ແລະ ເລືອກຊື່ຂອງກຳນົດການທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:31
msgid "Click btn:[Update Properties] to assign the maintenance schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Update Properties] ເພື່ອການກຳນົດກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you assign a new maintenance schedule to a client, it is possible that "
"the client might already have some restricted actions scheduled, and that "
"these might now conflict with the new maintenance schedule.  If this occurs, "
"the {webui} displays an error and you cannot assign the schedule to the "
"client.  To resolve this, check the btn:[Cancel affected actions] option "
"when you assign the schedule.  This cancels any previously scheduled actions "
"that conflict with the new maintenance schedule."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບ client, ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ client ອາດຈະມີ ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕັ້ງເວລາໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຂັດແຍ້ງ ກັບກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່. ຫາກເກີດເຫດການນີ້, {webui} ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດກຳນົດການໃຫ້ກັບ client ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ ຕົວເລືອກ btn:[Cancel affected actions] ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດກຳນົດການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຍົກເລີກ ການດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ຕັ້ງເວລາໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັບກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you have created your maintenance windows, you can schedule restricted "
"actions, such as package upgrades, to be performed during the maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ maintenance windows ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງເວລາການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ເຊັ່ນ ການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການໃນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ວງເວລາ maintenance window."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling a Package Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງເວລາອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select "
"the client you want to upgrade, and go to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Upgrade] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List], ເລືອກ client ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Software[Packages > Upgrade]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Select the package to upgrade from the list, and click btn:[Upgrade "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດຈາກລາຍການ, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Upgrade Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Maintenance Window`` field, select which maintenance "
"window the client should use to perform the upgrade."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Maintenance Window``, ເລືອກ maintenance window ທີ່ client ຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the package upgrade."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Schedule Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:40
msgid ""
"When you create a calendar, it contains a number of events, which can be "
"either one-time events, or recurring events.  Each event contains a "
"``summary`` field.  If you want to create multiple maintenance schedules for "
"one calendar, you can specify events for each using the ``summary`` field."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງປະຕິທິນ, ມັນຈະປະກອບມີເຫດການຕ່າງໆ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນເຫດການຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ເຫດການທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ. ແຕ່ລະເຫດການຈະມີຊ່ອງ ``summary``. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ ຫຼາຍກຳນົດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາສຳລັບປະຕິທິນດຽວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸເຫດການສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກຳນົດການ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ ``summary``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For example, you might like to create a schedule for production servers, and "
"a different schedule for testing servers.  In this case, you would specify "
"``SUMMARY: Production Servers`` on events for the production servers, and "
"``SUMMARY: Testing Servers`` on events for the testing servers."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສ້າງກຳນົດການສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production servers), ແລະ ກຳນົດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງສຳລັບເຊີເວີທົດສອບ (testing servers). ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ທ່ານຈະ ລະບຸ ``SUMMARY: Production Servers`` ໃນເຫດການສຳລັບເຊີເວີໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ແລະ ``SUMMARY: Testing Servers`` ໃນເຫດການສຳລັບເຊີເວີທົດສອບ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "maint_windows_multi.png"
msgstr "maint_windows_multi.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:43
msgid ""
"There are two types of schedule: single, or multi.  If your calendar "
"contains events that apply to more than one schedule, then you must select "
"``multi``, and ensure you name the schedule according to the ``summary`` "
"field you used in the calendar file."
msgstr "ມີກຳນົດການສອງປະເພດຄື: single (ດ່ຽວ), ຫຼື multi (ຫຼາຍ). ຫາກປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ ມີເຫດການທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງກຳນົດການ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກ ``multi``, ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ທ່ານຕັ້ງຊື່ກຳນົດການໃຫ້ຕົງກັບຊ່ອງ ``summary`` ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ປະຕິທິນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Multi Schedule"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຳນົດການແບບ Multi"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type the name for your schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບກຳນົດການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:47
msgid "Ensure it matches the ``summary`` field of the calendar."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນຕົງກັບຊ່ອງ ``summary`` ຂອງປະຕິທິນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:48
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:54
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Multi`` option."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Multi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:51
msgid "To create the next schedule, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງກຳນົດການຖັດໄປ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type the name for your second "
"schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບກຳນົດການທີສອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:53
msgid "Ensure it matches the ``summary`` field of the second calendar."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນຕົງກັບຊ່ອງ ``summary`` ຂອງປະຕິທິນທີສອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:56
msgid "Repeat for each schedule you need to create."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກຳນົດການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restricted and Unrestricted Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:58
msgid ""
"This sections contains a complete list of restricted and unrestricted "
"actions."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Restricted actions can only be run during "
"a maintenance window.  The restricted actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຈະປ່ຽນແປງ client ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ client ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະ ໃນລະຫວ່າງ maintenance window ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:60
msgid "Package operations (for example, installing, updating, or removing packages)"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ການອັບເດດ, ຫຼື ການລຶບແພັກເກດ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:61
msgid "Patch updates"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:62
msgid "Rebooting a client"
msgstr "ການບູດ client ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:63
msgid "Rolling back transactions"
msgstr "ການຍ້ອນຄືນທຸລະກຳ (Rolling back transactions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:64
msgid "Configuration management changing tasks"
msgstr "ວຽກງານການປ່ຽນແປງການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:65
msgid "Applying a highstate (for Salt clients)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:66
msgid "Autoinstallation and reinstallation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:67
msgid "Remote commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote commands)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:68
msgid "Product migrations"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:69
msgid "Cluster operations"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຄັສເຕີ (Cluster operations)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:70
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, it is possible to run remote commands directly at any time "
"by navigating to menu:Salt[Remote Commands].  This applies whether or not "
"the Salt client is in a maintenance window.  For more information about "
"remote commands, see xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  If an action is not restricted it "
"is, by definition, unrestricted, and can be be run at any time."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການເລັກນ້ອຍທີ່ຖືວ່າປອດໄພ ແລະ ບໍ່ໜ້າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບ client. ຫາກການດຳເນີນການໃດໜຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈຳກັດ ມັນກໍຄືການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຄວາມໝາຍ, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a Client to Master Validation Fingerprint"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຢືນຢັນລາຍນິ້ວມື (Fingerprint) ຈາກ Client ຫາ Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In highly secure network configurations you may wish to ensure your Salt "
"clients are connecting a specific master.  To set up validation from client "
"to master enter the master's fingerprint within the "
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion`` configuration file, see the following procedure:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Master's Fingerprint to Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Fingerprint ຂອງ Master ໃຫ້ກັບ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the master, at the command prompt, as root, use this command to find the "
"``master.pub`` fingerprint:"
msgstr "ທີ່ master, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາ fingerprint ຂອງ ``master.pub``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -F master\n"
msgstr "salt-key -F master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On your client, open the [path]``/etc/salt/minion`` configuration file.  "
"Uncomment the following line and enter the master's fingerprint replacing "
"the example fingerprint:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"
msgstr "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:8
msgid "Restart the salt-minion service:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "# systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For information on configuring security from a client, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພຈາກ client, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using ``mgr-sync``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ ``mgr-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The ``mgr-sync`` tool is used at the command prompt.  It provides functions "
"for using {productname} that are not always available in the {webui}.  The "
"primary use of ``mgr-sync`` is to connect to the {scc}, retrieve product and "
"package information, and prepare channels for synchronization with the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This tool is designed for use with a {suse} support subscription.  It is not "
"required for open source distributions, including {opensuse}, {centos}, and "
"{ubuntu}."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ {suse}. ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ open source distributions, ລວມເຖິງ {opensuse}, {centos}, ແລະ {ubuntu}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The available commands and arguments for ``mgr-sync`` are listed in this "
"table.  Use this syntax for ``mgr-sync`` commands:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ອາຣ໌ກິວເມນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນນີ້ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``mgr-sync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Description | Example Use\n"
"| list | List channels, organization credentials, or products | ``mgr-sync "
"list channels``\n"
"| add | Add channels, organization credentials, or products | ``mgr-sync add "
"channel <channel_name>``\n"
"| refresh | Refresh the local copy of products, channels, and subscriptions "
"| ``mgr-sync refresh``\n"
"| delete | Delete existing SCC organization credentials from the local "
"system | ``mgr-sync delete credentials``\n"
"| sync | Synchronize specified channel or ask for it when left blank| "
"``mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>``\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:8
msgid "To see the full list of options specific to a command, use this command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກັບຄຳສັ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync <ຄຳສັ່ງ> --help\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Optional Arguments"
msgstr "ອາຣ໌ກິວເມນທາງເລືອກຂອງ mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Abbreviated option | Description | Example Use\n"
"| help | ``h`` | Display the command usage and options | ``mgr-sync "
"--help``\n"
"| version | N/A | Display the currently installed version of ``mgr-sync`` | "
"``mgr-sync --version``\n"
"| verbose | ``v`` | Provide verbose output | ``mgr-sync --verbose "
"refresh``\n"
"| store-credentials | ``s`` | Store credentials a local hidden file | "
"``mgr-sync --store-credentials``\n"
"| debug | ``d`` | Log additional debugging information. Requires a level of "
"1, 2, 3. 3 provides the highest amnount of debugging information | "
"``mgr-sync -d 3 refresh``\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Use with the ``add`` command to add products or channels "
"without beginning a synchronization | ``mgr-sync --no-sync add "
"<channel_name>``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ | ຕົວເລືອກແບບຫຍໍ້ | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້\n"
"| help | ``h`` | ສະແດງວິທີການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ | ``mgr-sync --help``\n"
"| version | N/A | ສະແດງເວີຊັນຂອງ ``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ | ``mgr-sync --version``\n"
"| verbose | ``v`` | ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດການເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງລະອຽດ | ``mgr-sync --verbose refresh``\n"
"| store-credentials | ``s`` | ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊ່ອນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ | ``mgr-sync --store-credentials``\n"
"| debug | ``d`` | ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂຈຸດບົກພ່ອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຕ້ອງການລະດັບ 1, 2, 3. ລະດັບ 3 ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ | ``mgr-sync -d 3 refresh``\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | ໃຊ້ກັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``add`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍບໍ່ເລີ່ມການ synchronize | ``mgr-sync --no-sync add <ຊື່_ຊ່ອງທາງ>``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:12
msgid "Logs for ``mgr-sync`` are located in:"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ (Logs) ສຳລັບ ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນເກັບໄວ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:13
msgid "[path]``/var/log/rhn/mgr-sync.log``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:14
msgid "[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_api.log``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror Source Packages"
msgstr "ການ Mirror ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບ (Source Packages)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you build your own packages locally, or if you require the source code "
"for your packages for legal reasons, it is possible to mirror the source "
"packages on {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງແພັກເກດເອງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ, ຫຼື ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ສຳລັບແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນທາງກົດໝາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດ mirror ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບ ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:3
msgid "Mirroring source packages can consume a significant amount of disk space."
msgstr "ການ mirror ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບອາດຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Mirroring Source Packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການ mirror ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration file, and add this "
"line:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"
msgstr "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:7
msgid "Restart the Spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ Spacewalk ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Currently, this feature can only be enabled globally for all repositories.  "
"It is not possible to select individual repositories for mirroring."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ແບບທົ່ວໄປ (globally) ສຳລັບທຸກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories). ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກແຕ່ລະບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອ mirror ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When this feature has been activated, the source packages become available "
"in the {productname} {webui} after the next repository synchronization.  "
"They are shown as sources for the binary package, and can be downloaded "
"directly from the {webui}.  Source packages cannot be installed on clients "
"using the {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແລ້ວ, ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼັງຈາກການ synchronize ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ສຳລັບແພັກເກດໄບນາຣີ (binary package), ແລະ ສາມາດດາວໂຫລດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ {webui}. ແພັກເກດຕົ້ນສະບັບບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ clients ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມດ້ວຍ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on Salt clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຝົ້າລະວັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana. {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ສາມາດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກສຸຂະພາບຂອງລະບົບເອງໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ບໍລິຫານ Prometheus exporters ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໄວ້ໃນ Salt clients ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງມື Client ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:7
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}12"
msgstr "{sle} 12"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:8
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}15"
msgstr "{sle} 15"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:6
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:9
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.x"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.x"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend to use a managed Salt {suse} client as "
"your monitoring server.  Other clients are not supported as a monitoring "
"server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  Clients must have "
"corresponding open ports and be reachable over the network.  Alternatively, "
"you can use reverse proxies to establish a connection."
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກແບບ pull, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດ ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ກັບ clients ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໄດ້. clients ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ (ports) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ reverse proxies ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You must have a monitoring add-on subscription for each client you want to "
"monitor.  Visit the {scc} to manage your {productname} subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "Prometheus ແລະ Grafana"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Prometheus is an open-source monitoring tool that is used to record "
"real-time metrics in a time-series database.  Metrics are pulled via HTTP, "
"enabling high performance and scalability."
msgstr "Prometheus ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕາມແບບ open-source ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກ ແບບເວລາຈິງ (real-time) ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບ time-series. ຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກຈະຖືກດຶງຜ່ານ HTTP, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວໄດ້ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics are time series data, or timestamped values belonging to "
"the same group or dimension.  A metric is uniquely identified by its name "
"and set of labels."
msgstr "Prometheus metrics ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນແບບ time series, ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ມີການບັນທຶກເວລາ (timestamp) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ມິຕິດຽວກັນ. metric ຈະຖືກລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນດ້ວຍຊື່ ແລະ ຊຸດຂອງປ້າຍກຳກັບ (labels)."

#.  TODO:: This should be an actual image.
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   metric name               labels                 timestamp     value\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  "
"42236\n"
msgstr ""
"   metric name               labels                 timestamp     value\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  42236\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Each application or system being monitored must expose metrics in the format "
"above, either through code instrumentation or Prometheus exporters."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມຕ້ອງສະແດງ metrics ໃນຮູບແບບຂ້າງເທິງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານການຂຽນໂຄ້ດ (code instrumentation) ຫຼື Prometheus exporters."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus Exporters"
msgstr "Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Exporters are libraries that help with exporting metrics from third-party "
"systems as Prometheus metrics.  Exporters are useful whenever it is not "
"feasible to instrument a given application or system with Prometheus metrics "
"directly.  Multiple exporters can run on a monitored host to export local "
"metrics."
msgstr "Exporters ແມ່ນໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການສົ່ງອອກ metrics ຈາກລະບົບພາຍນອກ ໃຫ້ເປັນ metrics ຂອງ Prometheus. Exporters ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ metrics ໃຫ້ກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ລະບົບນັ້ນໂດຍກົງໄດ້. ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ ຫຼາຍ exporters ໃນ host ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ metrics ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The Prometheus community provides a list of official exporters, and more can "
"be found as community contributions.  For more information and an extensive "
"list of exporters, see https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."
msgstr "ຊຸມຊົນ Prometheus ໄດ້ໃຫ້ລາຍການ exporters ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ, ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດຫາ ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຈາກການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງຊຸມຊົນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ລາຍການ exporters ທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງ https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Grafana is a tool for data visualization, monitoring, and analysis.  It is "
"used to create dashboards with panels representing specific metrics over a "
"set period of time.  Grafana is commonly used together with Prometheus, but "
"also supports other data sources such as ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, "
"and Influx DB.  For more information about Grafana, see "
"https://grafana.com/docs/."
msgstr "Grafana ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເບິ່ງເຫັນເປັນພາບ (data visualization), ການຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ການວິເຄາະ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແດຊ໌ບອດ (dashboards) ທີ່ມີແຜງ ສະແດງ metrics ທີ່ລະບຸໃນຊ່ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ. Grafana ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Prometheus, ແຕ່ກໍຮອງຮັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆເຊັ່ນ ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, ແລະ Influx DB. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Grafana, ເບິ່ງ https://grafana.com/docs/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the Monitoring Server"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:25
msgid ""
"To set up your monitoring server, you need to install Prometheus and "
"Grafana, and configure them."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Prometheus"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If your monitoring server is a Salt client, you can install the Prometheus "
"package using the {productname} {webui}.  Otherwise you can download and "
"install the package on your monitoring server manually.  The Prometheus "
"software is also available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} "
"Branch Server."
msgstr "ຫາກເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຂອງທ່ານເປັນ Salt client, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Prometheus ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ໃນເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຊອບແວ Prometheus ຍັງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} SMR Branch Server ນຳອີກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Prometheus expects POSIX filesystem for storing data.  Non-POSIX compliant "
"filesystems are not supported.  NFS filesystems are not supported."
msgstr "Prometheus ຕ້ອງການລະບົບໄຟລ໌ POSIX ສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ POSIX. ແລະ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ NFS."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus Using the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system where "
"Prometheus is to be installed, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` "
"tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Prometheus`` checkbox to enable monitoring formulas, "
"and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ monitoring formulas, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:32
msgid "Navigate to the ``Prometheus`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ ``Prometheus`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the ``{productname} Server`` section, enter valid {productname} API "
"credentials."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``{productname} Server``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ API ຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Make sure that the credentials you have entered allow access to the set of "
"systems you want to monitor."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວທີ່ທ່ານປ້ອນນັ້ນ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:64
msgid "Customize any other configuration options according to your needs."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:36
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:65
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:153
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:183
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Save Formula]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:37
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:66
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:184
msgid "Apply the highstate and confirm that it completes successfully."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ແລະ ຢືນຢັນວ່າມັນສຳເລັດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Check that the Prometheus interface loads correctly. In your browser, "
"navigate to the URL of the server where Prometheus is installed, on "
"port 9090 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງ Prometheus ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ທີ່ພອດ 9090 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:39
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:90
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:157
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:185
msgid ""
"For more information about the monitoring formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ monitoring formulas, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manually Installing and Configuring Prometheus"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:41
msgid ""
"On the monitoring server, install the "
"[package]``golang-github-prometheus-prometheus`` package:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``golang-github-prometheus-prometheus``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in golang-github-prometheus-prometheus\n"
msgstr "zypper in golang-github-prometheus-prometheus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:43
msgid "Enable the Prometheus service:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ Prometheus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now prometheus\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now prometheus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:45
msgid "Check that the Prometheus interface loads correctly."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງ Prometheus ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In your browser, navigate to the URL of the server where Prometheus is "
"installed, on port 9090 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ທີ່ພອດ 9090 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Open the configuration file at [path]``/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml`` and "
"add this configuration information."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [path]``/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Replace `server.url` with your {productname} server URL and adjust "
"`username` and `password` fields to match your {productname} credentials."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ `server.url` ເປັນ URL ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນຊ່ອງ `username` ແລະ `password` ໃຫ້ຕົງກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# {productname} self-health metrics\n"
"scrape_configs:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-server'\n"
"  static_configs:\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:9100'  # Node exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:9187'  # PostgreSQL exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:5556'  # JMX exporter (Tomcat)\n"
"      - 'server.url:5557'  # JMX exporter (Taskomatic)\n"
"      - 'server.url:9800'  # Taskomatic\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:80'    # Message queue\n"
"      labels:\n"
"        __metrics_path__: /rhn/metrics\n"
msgstr ""
"# {productname} self-health metrics\n"
"scrape_configs:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-server'\n"
"  static_configs:\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:9100'  # Node exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:9187'  # PostgreSQL exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:5556'  # JMX exporter (Tomcat)\n"
"      - 'server.url:5557'  # JMX exporter (Taskomatic)\n"
"      - 'server.url:9800'  # Taskomatic\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:80'    # Message queue\n"
"      labels:\n"
"        __metrics_path__: /rhn/metrics\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Managed systems metrics:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-clients'\n"
"  uyuni_sd_configs:\n"
"   - server: \"http://server.url\"\n"
"     username: \"admin\"\n"
"     password: \"admin\"\n"
"  relabel_configs:\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_exporter]\n"
"     target_label: exporter\n"
"   - source_labels: [__address__]\n"
"     replacement: \"No group\"\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_groups]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_minion_hostname]\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_primary_fqdn]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [hostname, __address__]\n"
"     regex: (.*);.*:(.*)\n"
"     replacement: ${1}:${2}\n"
"     target_label: __address__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_metrics_path]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: __metrics_path__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_proxy_module]\n"
"     target_label: __param_module\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_scheme]\n"
"     target_label: __scheme__\n"
msgstr ""
"# Managed systems metrics:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-clients'\n"
"  uyuni_sd_configs:\n"
"   - server: \"http://server.url\"\n"
"     username: \"admin\"\n"
"     password: \"admin\"\n"
"  relabel_configs:\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_exporter]\n"
"     target_label: exporter\n"
"   - source_labels: [__address__]\n"
"     replacement: \"No group\"\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_groups]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_minion_hostname]\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_primary_fqdn]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [hostname, __address__]\n"
"     regex: (.*);.*:(.*)\n"
"     replacement: ${1}:${2}\n"
"     target_label: __address__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_metrics_path]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: __metrics_path__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_proxy_module]\n"
"     target_label: __param_module\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_scheme]\n"
"     target_label: __scheme__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:51
msgid "Save the configuration file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:52
msgid "Restart the Prometheus service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ Prometheus ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart prometheus\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart prometheus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:54
msgid ""
"For more information about the Prometheus configuration options, see the "
"official Prometheus documentation at "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຂອງ Prometheus ທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Grafana"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If your monitoring server is a Salt client, you can install the Grafana "
"package using the {productname} {webui}.  Otherwise you can download and "
"install the package on your monitoring server manually."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:57
msgid "Grafana is not available on {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "Grafana ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Grafana Using the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:59
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system where "
"Grafana is to be installed, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Grafana`` checkbox to enable monitoring formulas, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Grafana`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ monitoring formulas, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:61
msgid "Navigate to the ``Grafana`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ ``Grafana`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:62
msgid ""
"In the ``Enable and configure Grafana`` section, enter the admin credentials "
"you want to use to log in Grafana."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``Enable and configure Grafana``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Grafana."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:63
msgid ""
"On the ``Datasources`` section, make sure that the Prometheus URL field "
"points to the system where Prometheus is running."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``Datasources``, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊ່ອງ URL ຂອງ Prometheus ຊີ້ໄປຍັງ ລະບົບທີ່ Prometheus ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Check that the Grafana interface is loading correctly. In your browser, "
"navigate to the URL of the server where Grafana is installed, on port 3000 "
"(for example, [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງ Grafana ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana, ທີ່ພອດ 3000 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:68
msgid ""
"{productname} provides pre-built dashboards for server self-health, basic "
"client monitoring, and more.  You can choose which dashboards to provision "
"in the formula configuration page."
msgstr "{productname} ໄດ້ໃຫ້ແດຊ໌ບອດທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບສຸຂະພາບຂອງເຊີເວີ, ການຕິດຕາມ client ພື້ນຖານ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກແດຊ໌ບອດທີ່ຈະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນໜ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ formula."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manually Installing Grafana"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:70
msgid "Install the [package]``grafana`` package:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``grafana``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in grafana\n"
msgstr "zypper in grafana\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:72
msgid "Enable the Grafana service:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ Grafana:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now grafana-server\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now grafana-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:74
msgid ""
"In your browser, navigate to the URL of the server where Grafana is "
"installed, on port 3000 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana, ທີ່ພອດ 3000 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:75
msgid "On the login page, enter ``admin`` for username and password."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ ``admin`` ສຳລັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:76
msgid "Click btn:[Log in]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Log in]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:77
msgid "If login is successful, then you will see a prompt to change the password."
msgstr "ຫາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:78
msgid "Click btn:[OK] on the prompt, then change your password."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[OK] ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Move your cursor to the cog icon on the side menu which will show the "
"configuration options."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີ (cursor) ໄປທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບເຟືອງໃນເມນູດ້ານຂ້າງ ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "grafana_sidemenu_datasource.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:81
msgid "Click btn:[Data sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Data sources]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:82
msgid "Click btn:[Add data source] to see a list of all supported data sources."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Add data source] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:83
msgid "Choose the Prometheus data source."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:84
msgid "Make sure to specify the correct URL of the Prometheus server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລະບຸ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີ Prometheus ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:85
msgid "Click btn:[Save & test]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Save & test]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:86
msgid ""
"To import a dashboard click the btn:[+] icon in the side menu, and then "
"click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າແດຊ໌ບອດ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ btn:[+] ໃນເມນູດ້ານຂ້າງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Import]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:87
msgid "For {productname} server overview load the dashboard ID: ``17569``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດແດຊ໌ບອດ ID: ``17569``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:88
msgid "For {productname} clients overview load the dashboard ID: ``17570``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງ {productname} clients ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດແດຊ໌ບອດ ID: ``17570``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "monitoring_grafana_example.png"
msgstr "monitoring_grafana_example.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:91
msgid ""
"For more information on how to manually install and configure Grafana, see "
"https://grafana.com/docs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Grafana ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ https://grafana.com/docs."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname} Monitoring"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕາມ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:93
msgid ""
"With {productname}{nbsp}4 and higher, you can enable the server to expose "
"Prometheus self-health metrics, and also install and configure exporters on "
"client systems."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍ {productname} 4 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ເຊີເວີເພື່ອສະແດງ Prometheus self-health metrics, ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ exporters ໃນລະບົບ client ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Self Monitoring"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມເຊີເວີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:95
msgid ""
"The Server self-health metrics cover hardware, operating system and "
"{productname} internals.  These metrics are made available by "
"instrumentation of the Java application, combined with Prometheus exporters."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກສຸຂະພາບຂອງເຊີເວີ (Server self-health metrics) ຈະກວມເອົາຮາດແວ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}. metrics ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໂດຍ ການກຳນົດຄ່າໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Java, ຮ່ວມກັບ Prometheus exporters."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:96
msgid "These exporter packages are shipped with {productname} Server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:97
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:106
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:138
msgid "Node exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-prometheus-node_exporter``."
msgstr "Node exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-prometheus-node_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:98
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:107
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:139
msgid "See https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:99
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:140
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-postgres_exporter``."
msgstr "PostgreSQL exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-postgres_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:100
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:141
msgid "See https://github.com/wrouesnel/postgres_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/wrouesnel/postgres_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:101
msgid "JMX exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-jmx_exporter``."
msgstr "JMX exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-jmx_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:102
msgid "See https://github.com/prometheus/jmx_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/prometheus/jmx_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:103
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:142
msgid "Apache exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter``."
msgstr "Apache exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:104
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:143
msgid "See https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:105
msgid "These exporter packages are shipped with {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ exporter ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມາກັບ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:108
msgid "Squid exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-boynux-squid_exporter``."
msgstr "Squid exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-boynux-squid_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:109
msgid "See https://github.com/boynux/squid-exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/boynux/squid-exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:110
msgid ""
"The exporter packages are pre-installed in {productname} Server and Proxy, "
"but their respective systemd daemons are disabled by default."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Self Monitoring"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:112
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Monitoring]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Manager Configuration > Monitoring]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:113
msgid "Click btn:[Enable services]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Enable services]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:114
msgid "Restart Tomcat and Taskomatic."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Navigate to the URL of your Prometheus server, on port 9090 (for example, "
"[literal]``http://example.com:9090``)"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີ Prometheus ຂອງທ່ານ, ທີ່ພອດ 9090 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the Prometheus UI, navigate to menu:[Status > Targets] and confirm that "
"all the endpoints on the ``mgr-server`` group are up."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:117
msgid ""
"If you have also installed Grafana with the {webui}, the server insights are "
"visible on the {productname} Server dashboard."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "monitoring_enable_services.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:119
msgid ""
"Only server self-health monitoring can be enabled using the {webui}.  "
"Metrics for a proxy are not automatically collected by Prometheus."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:120
msgid ""
"To enable self-health monitoring on a proxy, you need to manually install "
"exporters, including [literal]``prometheus-postgres_exporter``, and enable "
"them."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:121
msgid "The following relevant metrics are collected on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຄ່າວັດແທກ (metrics) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກເກັບກຳຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server statistics (port 80)"
msgstr "ສະຖິຕິຂອງເຊີເວີ (ພອດ 80)"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|Metric |Type | Description\n"
"\n"
"|uyuni_all_systems\n"
"|gauge\n"
"|Number of all systems\n"
"\n"
"|uyuni_virtual_systems\n"
"|gauge\n"
"|Number of virtual systems\n"
"\n"
"|uyuni_inactive_systems\n"
"|gauge\n"
