"Folder and script names change between distribution and version.  Examples "
"are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ຊື່ສະຄຣິບຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມດິສຕຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ເວີຊັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:86
