"| ກຸ່ມລະບົບ | [command]``system-groups`` | ກຸ່ມລະບົບ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ | [command]``system-groups-keys`` | ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ. | ບໍ່ |\n"
"| ລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບ | [command]``system-groups-systems`` | ໄຄເອັນໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຸ່ມລະບົບ | [command]``system-groups-users`` | ກຸ່ມລະບົບ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ. | ບໍ່ |\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: ລະບົບ | [command]``system-history`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໄຄເອັນ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: ຊ່ອງທາງ | [command]``system-history-channels`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການຊ່ອງທາງ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າ | [command]``system-history-configuration`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການການກຳນົດຄ່າ. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``created_date`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: ສິດທິ | [command]``system-history-entitlements`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການສິດທິລະບົບ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: Errata | [command]``system-history-errata`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການ Errata. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``created_date`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: Kickstart | [command]``system-history-kickstart`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການ Kickstart. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``created_date`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: ແພັກເກດ | [command]``system-history-packages`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການແພັກເກດ. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``created_date`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ປະຫວັດ: SCAP | [command]``system-history-scap`` | ປະຫວັດເຫດການ OpenSCAP. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``created_date`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ MD5 | [command]``system-md5-certificates`` | ໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີ MD5 checksum. | ບໍ່ |\n"
"| ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ | [command]``system-packages-installed`` | ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ. | ແມ່ນ |\n"
"| ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ລະບົບ | [command]``system-profiles`` | ໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີ, ພ້ອມຂໍ້ມູນຊອບແວ ແລະ ກຸ່ມລະບົບ. | ບໍ່ |\n"
"| ຜູ້ໃຊ້ | [command]``users`` | ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``organization_id`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ຜູ້ໃຊ້ MD5 | [command]``users-md5`` | ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດສຳລັບທຸກອົງກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານແບບ MD5, ພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ບົດບາດ. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``organization_id`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"
"| ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ | [command]``users-systems`` | ໄຄເອັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້. | ແມ່ນ | ຄໍລຳ ``organization_id`` ຖືກຍ້າຍອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about an individual report, run "
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` with the option [option]``--info`` or "
"[option]``--list-fields-info`` and the report name.  This shows the "
"description and list of possible fields in the report."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະບົດລາຍງານ, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``spacewalk-report`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--info`` ຫຼື [option]``--list-fields-info`` ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ບົດລາຍງານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ຟິວ (fields) ທີ່ມີໃນບົດລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For further information on program invocation and options, see the "
"[literal]``spacewalk-report(8)`` man page as well as the [option]``--help`` "
"parameter of the [command]``spacewalk-report`` command."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໜ້າ man page ຂອງ [literal]``spacewalk-report(8)`` ລວມທັງພາລາມິເຕີ [option]``--help`` ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Disk Space"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in some cases, is not recoverable."
msgstr "ການທີ່ເນື້ອທີ່ດິສກ໌ເຕັມສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນບາງກໍລະນີອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} monitors some directories for free disk space.  You can modify "
"which directories are monitored, and the warnings that are created.  All "
"settings are configured in the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "{productname} ຕິດຕາມບາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເພື່ອເບິ່ງເນື້ອທີ່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ວ່າງ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃດ ແລະ ກຳນົດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the available space in one of the monitored directories falls below a "
"warning threshold, a message is sent to the configured email address and a "
"notification is shown at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຕິດຕາມຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາອີເມລທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແລະ ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitored Directories"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:6
msgid "By default, {productname} monitors these directories:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະຕິດຕາມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:7
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:8
msgid "[path]``/var/spacewalk``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/spacewalk``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:9
msgid "[path]``/var/cache``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:10
msgid "[path]``/srv``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can change which directories are monitored with the "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` parameter.  You can specify multiple "
"directories by separating them with a space."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs``. ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໂດຍແຍກກັນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecheck_dirs = /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\n"
msgstr "spacecheck_dirs = /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "ເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} creates a warning when a monitored directory has "
"less than 10% of total space available.  A critical alert is created when a "
"monitored directory falls below 5% space available."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະສ້າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຕິດຕາມມີເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 10% ຂອງເນື້ອທີ່ທັງໝົດ. ແລະ ຈະສ້າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂັ້ນວິກິດ (critical) ເມື່ອເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າ 5%."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can change these alert thresholds with the "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_free_alert`` and "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_free_critical`` parameters."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_free_alert`` ແລະ [systemitem]``spacecheck_free_critical``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecheck_free_alert = 10\n"
"spacecheck_free_critical = 5\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecheck_free_alert = 10\n"
"spacecheck_free_critical = 5\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shut Down Services"
msgstr "ການປິດການບໍລິການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} shuts down the spacewalk services when the "
"critical alert threshold is reached."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະປິດການບໍລິການ spacewalk ເມື່ອເຖິງເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂັ້ນວິກິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can change this behavior with the [systemitem]``spacecheck_shutdown`` "
"parameter.  A value of ``true`` enables the shut down feature.  Any other "
"value disables it."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_shutdown``. ຄ່າ ``true`` ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການປິດບໍລິການ, ສ່ວນຄ່າອື່ນໆແມ່ນການປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecheck_shutdown = true\n"
msgstr "spacecheck_shutdown = true\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Space Checking"
msgstr "ປິດການກວດສອບເນື້ອທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The space checking tool is enabled by default.  You can disable it entirely "
"with these commands:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບເນື້ອທີ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນທັງໝົດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
"systemctl disable spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
msgstr ""
"systemctl stop spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"
"systemctl disable spacewalk-diskcheck.timer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Disabling the [literal]``spacewalk-diskcheck.timer`` will stop periodic "
"email alerts if the alert threshold is reached, but the warning notification "
"will still appear at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "ການປິດ [literal]``spacewalk-diskcheck.timer`` ຈະຢຸດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານອີເມລເປັນໄລຍະເມື່ອເຖິງເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ແຕ່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ HTTP ແບບເຂັ້ມງວດ (HSTS)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"HTTP Strict Transport Security "
"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security[https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security]is "
"a policy mechanism that helps to protect websites against man-in-the-middle "
"attacks such as protocol downgrade attacks and cookie hijacking."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} allows enabling HSTS, to enable it for a {productname} Server:"
msgstr "{productname} ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ HSTS, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Server ໃຫ້ເຮັດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Create new configuration file in `/etc/apache2/conf.d/<filename>.conf`, for "
"example `/etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-custom.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:6
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Add line `Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=63072000; "
"includeSubDomains\"`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:7
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:12
msgid "Restart Apache with `systemctl restart apache2`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:8
msgid "To enable it for {productname} Proxies:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Proxies:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create new configuration file in `/etc/apache2/conf.d/<filename>.conf`, for "
"example `/etc/apache2/conf.dz/zz-spacewalk-proxy-custom.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When naming the new config file [literal]``<filename>.conf``, make sure it "
"is loaded at the right time.  For example, to override something defined in "
"[literal]``spacewalk-www.conf`` the new file needs to be alphabetically "
"after this file.  For more information about how Apache loads files, see "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs[https://httpd.apache.org/docs]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:14
msgid "[IMPORTANT]"
msgstr "[ຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນ]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When HSTS is enabled while using the default SSL certificate generated by "
"{productname} or a self-signed certificate, browsers will refuse to connect "
"with HTTPS unless the CA used to sign such certificates is trusted by the "
"browser.  If you are using the SSL certificate generated by {productname}, "
"you can trust it by importing the file located at "
"**+http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT+** to the browsers "
"of all users."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.
#. For additional security, you can import a custom certificate, signed by a third party certificate authority (CA).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure SSL certificate for new {productname} "
"installation, and how to replace existing certificates."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການກຳນົດຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່, ແລະ ວິທີປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ (public certificate) ຂອງ SSL ຈາກຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA). ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ CA chain, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ລະດັບກາງ (intermediate CAs) ທັງໝົດກໍຕ້ອງມີພ້ອມຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:5
msgid "An SSL server private key"
msgstr "SSL server private key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:6
msgid "An SSL server certificate"
msgstr "SSL server certificate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:7
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` section of the "
"certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment "
"requires it.  Supported Key types are [literal]``RSA`` and [literal]``EC`` "
"(Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL server ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ໂຮສເຕັມ (fully qualified hostname) ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຮສໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຊື່ໂຮສຖ້າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ປະເພດຄີທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ [literal]``RSA`` ແລະ [literal]``EC`` (Elliptic Curve)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Third-party authorities commonly use intermediate CAs to sign requested "
"server certificates.  In this case, all CAs in the chain are required to be "
"available.  If there is no extra parameter or option available to specify "
"intermediate CAs, take care that all CAs (Root CA and intermediate CAs) are "
"stored in one file."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນພາຍນອກມັກຈະໃຊ້ intermediate CAs ເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, CA ທັງໝົດໃນ chain ຕ້ອງມີພ້ອມ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີ ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກເສີມເພື່ອລະບຸ intermediate CAs, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ CA ທັງໝົດ (Root CA ແລະ intermediate CAs) ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Installations"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  After you have "
"completed the initial setup, you can replace the default certificate with an "
"imported certificate."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import Certificates on a New {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Server ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Install the {productname} Server according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Complete the initial setup according to "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:15
msgid ""
"At the command prompt, point the SSL environment variables to the "
"certificate file locations:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export CA_CERT=<path_to_CA_certificates_file>\n"
"export SERVER_KEY=<path_to_web_server_key>\n"
"export SERVER_CERT=<path_to_web_server_certificate>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:17
msgid "Complete {productname} setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME: where "at the command prompt"?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:19
msgid ""
"When you are prompted for certificate details during setup, fill in random "
"values.  The values are overridden by the values you specified at the "
"command prompt."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Execute the [command]``yast susemanager_setup`` command from the same shell "
"you exported the environment variables from."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Proxy Installations"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:22
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Proxy uses a self-signed certificate.  After you "
"have completed the initial setup, you can replace the default certificate "
"with an imported certificate."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} Proxy ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import Certificates on a New {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Install the {productname} Proxy according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Complete the initial setup according to "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:26
msgid "At the command prompt, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-proxy.sh\n"
msgstr "configure-proxy.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:28
msgid ""
"At the ``Do you want to import existing certificates?`` prompt, type "
"kbd:[y]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:29
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete setup."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ສະແດງເພື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Use the same certificate authority (CA) to sign all server certificates for "
"servers and proxies.  Certificates signed with different CAs do not match."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ດຽວກັນເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດສຳລັບເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍ CA ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace Certificates"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:32
msgid ""
"You can replace active certificates on your {productname} installation with "
"a new certificate.  To replace the certificates, you can replace the "
"installed CA certificate with the new CA, and then update the database."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ດ້ວຍ CA ໃໝ່, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing Existing Certificates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:35
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, call the command "
"[command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` with the certificates as parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-ssl-cert-setup --root-ca-file=<Path_to_Root_CA_Certificate> \\\n"
"  --server-cert-file=<Server_Cert_File> "
"--server-key-file=<Server_Key_File>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Intermediate CAs can either be available in the file which is specified with "
"`--root-ca-file` or specified as extra options with "
"`--intermediate-ca-file`.  The `--intermediate-ca-file` option can be "
"specified multiple times.  This command performs a number of tests on the "
"provided files to test if they are valid and can be used for the requested "
"use case."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:38
msgid "Restart services to pick up the changes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-service stop\n"
"systemctl restart postgresql.service\n"
"spacewalk-service start\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Proxy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If you are using a proxy, you need to generate a server certificate for the "
"proxy on the {productname} server and copy the files to the proxy.  "
"Alternatively, you let your own Certificate Authority generate these files "
"and provide them on the proxy.  After the files are availableon the proxy, "
"use [command]``mgr-ssl-cert-setup`` also on a {productname} Proxy to replace "
"the certificates.  Because the {productname} Proxy does not have a "
"postgreSQL database, the dedicated proxy restart command is sufficient:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy restart\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy the Root CA on Salt Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:44
msgid ""
"If the Root CA was changed, it needs to get deployed to all the clients "
"connected to {productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າ Root CA ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying the Root CA on Salt Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:46
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:47
msgid "Check all your Salt Clients to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:48
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``States`` field, click btn:[Apply] to apply the system "
"states."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``States``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Apply] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ສະຖານະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Highstate`` page, click btn:[Apply Highstate] to propagate "
"the changes to the clients."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Highstate``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Apply Highstate] ເພື່ອສົ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extra handling of traditional Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:52
msgid "Traditional Clients are deprecated and should be replaced with Salt Client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:53
msgid ""
"If the CA needs to be replaced when there are still traditional managed "
"clients connected to {productname} some extra steps are required."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Important is, that the clients do not get disconnected when the new CA is "
"activated on the {productname} Server and Proxies.  Deploy the 'old' and the "
"'new' Root CA certificates to the affected clients and trust them.  Use a "
"configuration channel to deploy the certificte files to the clients and the "
"remote command feature to regenerate the trust store."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:55
msgid ""
"After the new certificates are activated on the {productname} Server and "
"Proxies, test if the connections are working and actions can still be "
"scheduled on the clients.  If this is the case, the 'old' Root CA can be "
"removed from clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self-Signed SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  In this case, the "
"certificate is created and signed by {productname}.  This method does not "
"use an independent certificate authority to guarantee that the details of "
"the certificate are correct.  Third-party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ເເຊັນໂດຍ {productname} ເອງ. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນອິດສະຫຼະເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ. ແຕ່ CA ພາຍນອກຈະມີການກວດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on third-party CAs, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CA ພາຍນອກ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information on replacing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create or re-create your self-signed certificates "
"on new or existing installation."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການສ້າງ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຂອງທ່ານ ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL keys and certificates must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງ SSL keys ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ໂຮສເຕັມຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Re-Create Existing Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If your existing certificates have expired or stopped working for any "
"reason, you can generate a new server certificate from the existing CA."
msgstr "ຖ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼື ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຈາກ CA ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Re-Creating an Existing Server Certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, regenerate the server "
"certificate:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\" "
"--no-rpm\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:12
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Ensure that the [systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter is the fully qualified "
"domain name of your {productname} Server.  You can use the "
"[systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter multiple times if you require multiple "
"aliases."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ແມ່ນຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``set-cname`` ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊື່ອາລີເອດ (aliases) ຫຼາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The private key and the server certificate can be found in the directory "
"`/root/ssl-build/susemanager/` as `server.key` and `server.crt`.  The name "
"of the last directory depends on the hostname used with `--set-hostname` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Deploy the new certificate and key using the `mgr-ssl-cert-setup` tool.  For "
"more information see as "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new CA and Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງ CA ໃໝ່ ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Be careful when you need to replace the Root CA.  It is possible to break "
"the trust chain between the server and clients.  If that happens, you need "
"an administrative user to log in to every client and deploy the CA directly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງເມື່ອຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແທນ Root CA. ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສາຍໃຍຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື (trust chain) ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນຂາດລົງ. ຖ້າເກີດເຫດການນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເພື່ອລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນທຸກໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ CA ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating New Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, move the old certificate "
"directory to a new location:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:20
msgid "Generate a new CA certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" "
"\\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA "
"Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:22
msgid "Generate a new server certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You need to generate a server certificate also for each proxy, using their "
"hostnames and cnames."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີຄືກັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ cnames ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຄເອັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Every client that uses SSL to register to the {productname} Server checks "
"that it is connecting to the right server by validating against a server "
"certificate.  This process is called an SSL handshake."
msgstr "ທຸກໄຄເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ SSL ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} Server ຈະກວດສອບວ່າມັນກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ SSL handshake."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"During the SSL handshake, the client checks that the hostname in the server "
"certificate matches what it expects.  The client also needs to check if the "
"server certificate is trusted."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ໄຄເອັນຈະກວດສອບວ່າຊື່ໂຮສໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີກົງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ມັນຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ໄຄເອັນຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຫຼືບໍ່."

#. Every {productname} Server that uses SSL requires an SSL server certificate.
#. Provide the path to the server certificate using the ``SERVER_CERT`` environment variable during setup, or with the ``--from-server-cert`` option of the [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Certificate authorities (CAs) are certificates that are used to sign other "
"certificates.  All certificates must be signed by a certificate authority "
"(CA) in order for them to be considered valid, and for clients to be able to "
"successfully match against them."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CAs) ແມ່ນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນອື່ນໆ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຊັນໂດຍ CA ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກັບພວກມັນໄດ້."

#. When an organization signs its own certificate, the certificate is considered self-signed.
#. A self-signed certificate is straight-forward to set up, and does not cost any money, but they are considered less secure.
#. If you are using a self-signed certificate, you have a root CA that is signed with itself.
#. When you look at the details of a root CA, you can see that the subject has the same value as the issuer.
#. Provide the path to your root CA certificate using the ``CA_CERT`` environment variable during setup, or with the ``--ca-cert`` option of the [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In order for SSL authentication to work correctly, the client must trust the "
"root CA.  This means that the root CA must be installed on every client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SSL ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໄຄເອັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື root CA. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ root CA ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນທຸກໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The default method of SSL authentication is for {productname} to use "
"self-signed certificates.  In this case, {productname} has generated all the "
"certificates, and the root CA has signed the server certificate directly."
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SSL ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ໄດ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດ ແລະ root CA ໄດ້ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An alternative method is to use an intermediate CA.  In this case, the root "
"CA signs the intermediate CA.  The intermediate CA can then sign any number "
"of other intermediate CAs, and the final one signs the server certificate.  "
"This is referred to as a chained certificate."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການໃຊ້ intermediate CA. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, root CA ຈະເຊັນ intermediate CA. ຈາກນັ້ນ intermediate CA ສາມາດເຊັນ intermediate CAs ອື່ນໆໄດ້ບໍ່ຈຳກັດ, ແລະ ອັນສຸດທ້າຍຈະເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ chained certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you are using intermediate CAs in a chained certificate, the root CA is "
"installed on the client, and the server certificate is installed on the "
"server.  During the SSL handshake, clients must be able to verify the entire "
"chain of intermediate certificates between the root CA and the server "
"certificate, so they must be able to access all the intermediate "
"certificates."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate CAs ໃນ chained certificate, root CA ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ, ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຊີເວີ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ໄຄເອັນຕ້ອງສາມາດກວດສອບທັງໝົດ chain ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລະດັບກາງລະຫວ່າງ root CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ intermediate certificates ທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"There are two main ways of achieving this.  In older versions of "
"{productname}, by default, all the intermediate CAs are installed on the "
"client.  However, you could also configure your services on the server to "
"provide them to the client.  In this case, during the SSL handshake, the "
"server presents the server certificate as well as all the intermediate CAs.  "
"This mechanism is used now as the default configuration."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີຫຼັກໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້. ໃນ {productname} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານໃນເຊີເວີເພື່ອສົ່ງພວກມັນໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ເຊີເວີຈະສະແດງທັງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ແລະ intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດ. ກົນໄກນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. Whichever method you choose, you must ensure that the ``CA_CERT`` environment variable points to the root CA, and all intermediate CAs.
#. It should not contain the server certificate.
#. The server certificate must be defined at the ``SERVER_CERT`` environment variable.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate without "
"intermediate CAs.  For additional security, you can arrange a third party CA "
"to sign your certificates.  Third party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct.  They usually "
"charge an annual fee for this service.  Using a third party CA makes "
"certificates harder to spoof, and provides additional protection for your "
"installation.  If you have certificates signed by a third party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍບໍ່ມີ intermediate CAs. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. CA ພາຍນອກຈະກວດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຕ້ອງ. ພວກເຂົາມັກຈະຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການເປັນລາຍປີ. ການໃຊ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຮັດໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກປອມແປງໄດ້ຍາກ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າພວກມັນມາຍັງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:12
msgid "This manual describe the use of SSL certificates in two steps:"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍການນຳໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໃນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:13
msgid "How to create a self-signed certificate with {productname} tools"
msgstr "ວິທີການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:14
msgid "How to deploy a certificate on {productname} Server or Proxy"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case the certificates are provided by a third party instance like an own "
"or external PKI, step 1 can be skipped."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຈັດຫາໃຫ້ໂດຍໜ່ວຍງານພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່ນ PKI ຂອງຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ພາຍນອກ, ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ສາມາດຂ້າມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about creating self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about importing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription Matching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your {suse} products require subscriptions, which are managed by the {scc} "
"(SCC).  {productname} runs a nightly report checking the subscription status "
"of all your registered clients against your SCC account.  The report gives "
"you information about which clients consume which subscriptions, how many "
"subscriptions you have remaining and available to use, and which clients do "
"not have a current subscription."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] to see the report."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງບົດລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` tab gives information about current "
"and expiring subscriptions."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` tab gives a list of clients that "
"do not have a current subscription.  This includes clients that could not be "
"matched, or that are not currently registered with {productname}.  The "
"report includes product names and the number of systems that remain "
"unmatched."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}. ບົດລາຍງານປະກອບດ້ວຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຍັງຈັບຄູ່ບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Pins`` tab allows you to associate individual clients to the "
"relevant subscription.  This is especially useful if the subscription "
"manager is not automatically associating clients to subscriptions "
"successfully."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Pins`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງໄຄເອັນແຕ່ລະອັນເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຖ້າ subscription manager ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Messages`` tab shows all the messages generated by "
"subscription matcher during the matching process.  They provide information "
"to help understand the results and to improve the matching."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Messages`` ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ subscription matcher ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຈັບຄູ່. ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃນການປັບປຸງການຈັບຄູ່ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also download the reports in .csv format, or access them from that "
"command prompt in the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດບົດລາຍງານໃນຮູບແບບ .csv ຫຼື ເຂົ້າເຖິງພວກມັນຜ່ານຄອມມານລາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the subscription matcher runs daily, at midnight.  To change "
"this, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and click "
"``gatherer-matcher-default``.  Change the schedule as required, and click "
"btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, subscription matcher ຈະລັນທຸກມື້ໃນຕອນທ່ຽງຄືນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລ້ວຄລິກ ``gatherer-matcher-default``. ປ່ຽນກຳນົດເວລາຕາມຕ້ອງການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Because the report can only match current clients with current "
"subscriptions, you might find that the matches change over time.  The same "
"client does not always match the same subscription.  This can be due to new "
"clients being registered or unregistered, or because of the addition or "
"expiration of subscriptions."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບົດລາຍງານສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນໃນປັດຈຸບັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ. ໄຄເອັນດຽວກັນອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນເດີມສະເໝີໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຈາກການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່, ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ຫຼື ການເພີ່ມ ແລະ ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher automatically attempts to reduce the number of "
"unmatched products, limited by the terms and conditions of the subscriptions "
"in your account.  However, if you have incomplete hardware information, "
"unknown virtual machine host assignments, or clients running in unknown "
"public clouds, the matcher might show that you do not have enough "
"subscriptions available.  Always ensure you have complete data about your "
"clients included in {productname}, to help ensure accuracy."
msgstr "Subscription matcher ຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ virtual machine host ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ, ຫຼື ມີໄຄເອັນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ public cloud ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ, matcher ອາດຈະສະແດງວ່າທ່ານມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບສະເໝີວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບໄຄເອັນໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher does not always match clients and subscriptions "
"accurately.  It is not intended to be a replacement for auditing."
msgstr "Subscription matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ 100%. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນການກວດສອບ (auditing)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin Clients to Subscriptions"
msgstr "ການປັກໝຸດໄຄເອັນເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If the subscription matcher is not automatically matching a particular "
"client with the correct subscription, you can manually pin them.  When you "
"have created a pin, the subscription matcher favors matching a specific "
"subscription with a given system or group of systems."
msgstr "ຖ້າ subscription matcher ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນສະເພາະອັນໃດໜຶ່ງກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປັກໝຸດພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການປັກໝຸດແລ້ວ, subscription matcher ຈະໃຫ້ບຸລິມະສິດໃນການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸກັບລະບົບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລະບົບນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:15
msgid ""
"However, the matcher does not always respect a pin.  It depends on the "
"subscription being available, and whether or not the subscription can be "
"applied to the client.  Additionally, pins are ignored if they result in a "
"match that violates the terms and conditions of the subscription, or if the "
"matcher detects a more accurate match if the pin is ignored."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຕາມການປັກໝຸດສະເໝີໄປ. ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າການສະໝັກໃຊ້ນັ້ນຍັງວ່າງຢູ່ບໍ່ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນນັ້ນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການປັກໝຸດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ລະເມີດຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຫຼື ຖ້າ matcher ພົບການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າຫາກລະເລີຍການປັກໝຸດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:16
msgid "To add a new pin, click btn:[Add a Pin], and select the client to pin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການປັກໝຸດໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Add a Pin], ແລ້ວເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປັກໝຸດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We do not recommend using pinning regularly, or for a large number of "
"clients.  The subscription matcher tool is generally accurate enough for "
"most installations."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການປັກໝຸດເປັນປະຈຳ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວເຄື່ອງມື subscription matcher ແມ່ນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Schedules"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາວຽກ (Task Schedules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:2
msgid "All predefined task bunches are listed under menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_task_schedules.png"
msgstr "admin_task_schedules.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click menu:SUSE Manager Schedules[Schedule name] to open the menu:Schedule "
"Name[Basic Schedule Details].  You can disable it or change the frequency."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Edit Schedule] to update the schedule with your settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Edit Schedule] ເພື່ອອັບເດດກຳນົດເວລາດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Disable Schedule] in the upper right-hand corner to disable a "
"schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Disable Schedule] ຢູ່ແຈຂວາເທິງເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Only disable a schedule if you are absolutely certain this is necessary as "
"they are essential for {productname} to work properly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານກຳນົດເວລາກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈແທ້ໆວ່າມັນຈຳເປັນ ເພາະວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When a task is disabled, it is still shown in the list.  When you click "
"menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] you can activate the job again "
"by clicking btn:[Activate Schedule]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວຽກຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່. ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ menu:{productname} Schedules[ຊື່ກຳນົດເວລາ] ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານວຽກນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ btn:[Activate Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you click a bunch name, a list of runs of that bunch type and their "
"status is displayed."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມວຽກ (bunch name), ລາຍຊື່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງກຸ່ມນັ້ນ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Clicking the start time links takes you back to the menu:Schedule Name[Basic "
"Schedule Details]."
msgstr "ການຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະພາທ່ານກັບໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule Name[ລາຍລະອຽດກຳນົດເວລາພື້ນຖານ]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined task bunches"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The following predefined task bunches are scheduled by default and can be "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:auto-errata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:auto-errata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:14
msgid "Schedules auto errata updates as necessary."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການອັບເດດ errata ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:16
msgid "(Re)generates repository metadata files."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (ໃໝ່) ໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບ (repository)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale package change log and monitoring time series data from the "
"database."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດການປ່ຽນແປງແພັກເກດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ monitoring time series ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Clears task engine (taskomatic) history data older than a specified number "
"of days, depending on the job type, from the database."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດຂອງ task engine (taskomatic) ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ລະບຸອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງວຽກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Synchronizes distribution and profile data from {productname} to {cobbler}.  "
"For more information about autoinstallation powered by {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນການແຈກຢາຍ (distribution) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈາກ {productname} ໄປຍັງ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ autoinstallation ທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນດ້ວຍ {cobbler}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:compare-configs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:compare-configs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Compares configuration files as stored in configuration channels with the "
"files stored on all configuration-enabled servers.  To review comparisons, "
"click menu:Systems[] tab and select the system of interest.  Go to "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files].  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງການປຽບທຽບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກແທັບ menu:Systems[] ແລ້ວເລືອກລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Compare Files]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Updates internal pre-computed CVE data that is used to display results on "
"the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] page.  Search results in the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] "
"page are updated to the last run of this schedule.  For more information, "
"see xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ພາຍໃນທີ່ຖືກຄຳນວນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]. ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຕາມການລັນຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງກຳນົດເວລານີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:daily-status-default[]"
msgstr "menu:daily-status-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Sends daily report e-mails to relevant addresses.  For more information "
"about configuring notifications for specific users, see "
"xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມລບົດລາຍງານປະຈຳວັນໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ວາງໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-cache-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-cache-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Updates internal patch cache database tables, which are used to look up "
"packages that need updates for each server.  Also, this sends notification "
"emails to users that might be interested in certain patches.  For more "
"information about patches, see xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch cache ພາຍໃນ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງອັບເດດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ອາດຈະສົນໃຈໃນແພັດບາງອັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແພັດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-queue-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Queues automatic updates (patches) for servers that are configured to "
"receive them."
msgstr "ຈັດຄິວການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແພັດ) ສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮັບພວກມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"
msgstr "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Gather virtual host data by running Virtual Host Gatherer configured in "
"Virtual Host Managers.  After updated data are available, the Subscription "
"Matcher job is run."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນ virtual host ໂດຍການລັນ Virtual Host Gatherer ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Virtual Host Managers. ຫຼັງຈາກມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ, ວຽກ Subscription Matcher ຈະຖືກລັນຕໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:36
msgid "Cleans up stale {kickstart} session data."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນເຊດຊັນ (session) ຂອງ {kickstart} ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Generates {cobbler} files corresponding to {kickstart} profiles created by "
"the configuration wizard."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ກົງກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ configuration wizard."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Synchronizes client registration data with {scc}.  By default, new, changed, "
"or deleted client data are forwarded.  To disable synchronization set in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Disabling data synchronizing with SCC will lead to reduced visibility of "
"your managed clients between RMT, SMT, {productname} and SCC-directly "
"registered clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:43
msgid "By synchronizing data, you ensure a uniform view of all registered clients."
msgstr "ໂດຍການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ, ທ່ານຈະໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ client ທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແມ່ນກົງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:44
msgid ""
"https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[Help us "
"improve our services by sharing your reason for opting out]"
msgstr "https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[ຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົາປັບປຸງການບໍລິການໂດຍການແບ່ງປັນເຫດຜົນຂອງທ່ານໃນການຍົກເລີກ]"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Synchronizes with {scc} (``mgr-sync-refresh``).  By default, all custom "
"channels are also synchronized as part of this task.  For more information "
"about custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:48
msgid "Cleans up outdated action chain data."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນ action chain ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Deletes stale client action data from the file system.  First it tries to "
"complete any possibly unfinished actions by looking up the corresponding "
"results stored in the {salt} job cache.  An unfinished action can occur if "
"the server has missed the results of the action.  For successfully completed "
"actions it removes artifacts such as executed script files."
msgstr "ລົບຂໍ້ມູນການດຳເນີນການຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ທຳອິດມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສຳເລັດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບໃນ {salt} job cache. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ສຳເລັດອາດເກີດຈາກເຊີເວີພາດຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະລົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກລັນໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:52
msgid "Performs a regular check-in on clients."
msgstr "ເຮັດການ check-in ຕາມປົກກະຕິໃນໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:54
msgid "Cleans up expired notification messages."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#.  menu:oval-data-sync-default[]::
#.  Generate OVAL data required to increase the accuracy of CVE audit queries.
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:56
msgid "Deletes stale package files from the file system."
msgstr "ລົບໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Any reboot actions pending for more than six hours are marked as failed and "
"associated data is cleaned up from the database.  For more information on "
"scheduling reboot actions, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຣີບູດ (reboot) ໃດໆທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ເກີນ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກລ້າງອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດເວລາຣີບູດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:sandbox-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:sandbox-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Cleans up Sandbox configuration files and channels that are older than the "
"__sandbox_lifetime__ configuration parameter (3 days by default).  Sandbox "
"files are those imported from systems or files under development.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-add-files[]."
msgstr "ລ້າງໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງໃນ Sandbox ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າພາລາມິເຕີ __sandbox_lifetime__ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 3 ມື້). ໄຟລ໌ Sandbox ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກລະບົບ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການພັດທະນາ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-add-files[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale Web interface sessions, typically data that is temporarily "
"stored when a user logs in and then closes the browser before logging out."
msgstr "ລ້າງເຊດຊັນ Web interface ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ, ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລັອກອິນແລ້ວປິດບຣາວເຊີໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ລັອກເອົາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:ssh-push-default[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Prompts clients to check in with {productname} via SSH if they are "
"configured with a `SSH Push` contact method."
msgstr ""

#.  menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]::
#.  Update the systems overview data.
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Runs a hardware refresh on all systems.  This happens only monthly and can "
"increase load on the {productname} Server.  The job uses "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting].  "
"For tuning the batch size, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."
msgstr "ລັນການຣີເຟຣຊຮາດແວໃນທຸກລະບົບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນພຽງເດືອນລະຄັ້ງ ແລະ ອາດເພີ່ມພາລະໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} Server. ວຽກນີ້ໃຊ້ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]. ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງຂະໜາດ batch, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Deletes expired repository tokens that are used by {salt} clients to "
"download packages and metadata."
msgstr "ລົບ repository tokens ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໂດຍ {salt} clients ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ ແລະ metadata."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-payg-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-payg-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:70
msgid "Collect authentication data from configured {payg} cloud instances."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:72
msgid "Updates the local Reporting Database."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (Local Reporting Database)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Collects all reporting data from peripheral {productname} Server and update "
"the Hub Reporting Database."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານທັງໝົດຈາກ {productname} Server ທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Hub Reporting."

#.  menu:update-system-overview-default[]::
#.  Regularly ensure the systems overview data are up to date.
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:76
msgid "Cleans up outdated UUID records."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ UUID ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Autoinstallation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Autoinstallation"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on your base channel, new autoinstallation profiles might be "
"subscribed to a channel that is missing required packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:3
msgid "For autoinstallation to work, these packages are required:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:4
msgid "[package]``pyOpenSSL``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:5
msgid "[package]``rhnlib``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:6
msgid "[package]``libxml2-python``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:7
msgid "[package]``spacewalk-koan``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:8
msgid "To resolve this issue, check these things first:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Check that the tools software channel related to the base channel in your "
"autoinstallation profile is available to your organization and your user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Check that the tools channel is available to your {productname} as a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື (tools channel) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Check that the required packages and any dependencies are available in the "
"associated channels.:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Bare Metal Systems"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If a bare metal system on the network is not automatically added to the "
"[guilabel]``Systems`` list, check these things first:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:3
msgid "You must have the [path]``pxe-default-image`` package installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:4
msgid ""
"File paths and parameters must be configured correctly. Check that the "
"[path]``vmlinuz0`` and [path]``initrd0.img`` files, which are provided by "
"[path]``pxe-default-image``, are in the locations specified in the "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Ensure the networking equipment connecting the bare metal system to the "
"{productname} server is working correctly, and that you can reach the "
"{productname} server IP address from the server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The bare metal system to be provisioned must have PXE booting enabled in the "
"boot sequence, and must not be attempting to boot an operating system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The DHCP server must be responding to DHCP requests during boot. Check the "
"PXE boot messages to ensure that:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:8
msgid "the DHCP server is assigning the expected IP address"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:9
msgid ""
"the DHCP server is assigning the the {productname} server IP address as "
"[option]``next-server`` for booting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:10
msgid "Ensure {cobbler} is running, and that the Discovery feature is enabled."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you see a blue {cobbler} menu shortly after booting, discovery has "
"started.  If it does not complete successfully, temporarily disable "
"automatic shutdown to help diagnose the problem. To disable automatic "
"shutdown:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select [option]``pxe-default-profile`` in the {cobbler} menu with the arrow "
"keys, and press the Tab key before the timer expires."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Add the kernel boot parameter [option]``spacewalk-finally=running`` using "
"the integrated editor, and press Enter to continue booting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Enter a shell with the username [option]``root`` and password "
"[option]``linux`` to continue debugging."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bare-metal-systems.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Due to a technical limitation, it is not possible to reliably distinguish a "
"new bare metal system from a system that has previously been discovered.  "
"Therefore, we recommended that you do not power on bare metal systems "
"multiple times, as this results in duplicate profiles."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Bootstrap Repository for End-of-Life Products"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Bootstrap Repository ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ (End-of-Life)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When supported products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are "
"automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server.  When a "
"product reaches end-of-life and becomes unsupported, bootstrap repositories "
"must be created manually if you want to continue using the product."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, bootstrap repositories ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ {productname} Server. ແຕ່ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນໝົດອາຍຸ (end-of-life) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrap repositories, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap repositories, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Bootstrap Repositories for End-Of-Life Products"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Bootstrap Repositories ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, list the "
"available unsupported bootstrap repositories with the [option]``--force`` "
"option, for example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap repository, using the appropriate repository name as "
"the product label:"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບຸດສະແຕຣັບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you do not want to create bootstrap repositories manually, you can check "
"whether LTSS is available for the product and bootstrap repository you need."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າ LTSS ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ bootstrap repository ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Clients Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (Cloned Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have used your hypervisor clone utility, and attempted to register "
"the cloned Salt client, you might get this error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືໂຄລນຂອງ hypervisor ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "We're sorry, but the system could not be found.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ບໍ່ພົບລະບົບດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This is caused by the new, cloned, system having the same machine ID as an "
"existing, registered, system.  You can adjust this manually to correct the "
"error and register the cloned system successfully."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກລະບົບໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາມີ machine ID ດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບທີ່ໂຄລນມາໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information and instructions, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Corrupt Repositories"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄັງເກັບ (Repositories) ເສຍຫາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The information in the repository metadata files can become corrupt or out "
"of date.  This can create problems with updating clients.  You can fix this "
"by removing the files and regenerating it.  With an new repository data "
"file, updates should operate as expected."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ຫຼ້າສະໄໝ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນການອັບເດດໄຄເອັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລົບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ ແລະ ສ້າງພວກມັນໃໝ່. ເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບໃໝ່, ການອັບເດດຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Corrupt Repository Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບທີ່ເສຍຫາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:4
msgid "Remove all files from [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>``."
msgstr "ລົບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you do not know the channel label, you can find it in the {productname} "
"{webui}, by navigating to menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຮູ້ channel label, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:6
msgid "Regenerate the file from the command line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache <channel-label>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Custom Channel with Conflicting Packages"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Conflicting packages in custom channel
#. Consequence: Creating bootstrap repo can fail
#. Fix: Separate trees from each other
#. Result: Clean and functional boostrap repo will be created
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a custom channel with conflicting packages features such as "
"creating a bootstrap repository can result in undefined behavior and make "
"registering clients fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (custom channel) ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການສ້າງ bootstrap repository ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຜິດປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For example, conflicting packages with higher version numbers could be "
"included into the bootstrap repository.  Such packages (for example, "
"[package]``python3-zmq`` or [package]``zeromq``) may corrupt the creation of "
"the bootstrap repository or cause issues during bootstrap of the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນທີ່ມີເລກເວີຊັນສູງກວ່າອາດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ bootstrap repository. ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ [package]``python3-zmq`` ຫຼື [package]``zeromq``) ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງ bootstrap repository ເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap ໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the custom channel (for example, an EPEL channel) is added below the "
"parent vendor channel, issues with conflicting packages cannot be solved "
"directly.  The way how to solve this is to separate the custom channel from "
"the vendor channel.  The custom channel needs to be created in a separate "
"tree.  In case that the custom channel needs to be delivered as a child, "
"such environemnt can be created using Content Lifecycle Management (CLM).  "
"Sources in a CLM project can be added there from different trees.  Using "
"such an approach, the custom channel stays below the parent within the built "
"environment.  However, the vendor channel tree stays without the custom "
"channel and the bootstrap repository.  Then registering clients works "
"correctly."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ ຊ່ອງທາງ EPEL) ຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (parent vendor channel), ບັນຫາເລື່ອງແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ວິທີແກ້ໄຂຄືການແຍກຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ. ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງໃນ tree ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ໃນຖານະຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child), ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຄງການ CLM ສາມາດເພີ່ມມາຈາກ tree ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໄດ້. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, tree ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຈະບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ bootstrap repository ທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນນັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນກໍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When the custom channel with the conflicting packages (salt, zeromq, and so "
"on) is created as a child channel, following steps can help to avoid the "
"issue:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ (salt, zeromq, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກ, ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Avoiding Conflicting Packages in Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Remove the custom channel as a child channel from parent channel.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກການເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create the custom channel in a separate tree.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃນໂຄງສ້າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To get the custom channel as a child channel within Content Lifecycle "
"Management (CLM):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກພາຍໃນການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (CLM):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[], and "
"click btn:[Create Project].  Enter [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Label``."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Content Lifecycle[], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]. ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Attach Source to the project.  Use the needed vendor channels and the custom "
"channel.  (sharing example using CentOS8)"
msgstr "ແນບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (Source) ໃສ່ໂຄງການ. ນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. (ຕົວຢ່າງການແບ່ງປັນໂດຍໃຊ້ CentOS8)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:12
msgid "Add environment into the Project.  For example, use CentOS8."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment) ເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ນຳໃຊ້ CentOS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To build the environment click the btn:[Build] button.  This creates an "
"environment with vendor and custom channels that can be associated with an "
"activation key and used to bootstrap the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບິວ (build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]. ນີ້ຈະສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີທັງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອບູດສະແຕຣັບ (bootstrap) ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Important note: In the CLM project, it is recommend to add a filter, which "
"excludes the problematic or conflicting packages.  Otherwise the conflicting "
"packages with higher version numbers would be installed during the update of "
"the client.  For more information about filtering, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດສຳຄັນ: ໃນໂຄງການ CLM, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filter), ເຊິ່ງຈະແຍກແພັກເກດທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນອອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນທີ່ມີລຸ້ນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the latest patches into the CLM environment (with vendor and custom "
"channel), click the btn:[Build] button in the project.  This is needed to "
"re-built the environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ແພັດ (patches) ຫຼ້າສຸດເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ CLM (ທີ່ມີທັງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ), ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນໂຄງການ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອສ້າງ (re-built) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about CLM, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CLM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Using the Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) directly on {rhel} "
"clients (or compatible: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, etc.) will install the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL, which miss some features available in the "
"{productname}-provided {salt} packages.  This is especially important "
"because it will result in a bootstrap repository containing the non-SUSE "
"{salt} packages.  Therefore, this is an unsupported scenario.  If you need "
"to enable the EPEL repository, make sure you filter out the {salt} packages "
"from EPEL in advance (for example, by removing the {salt} packages in "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disabling the FQDNS grain"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The FQDNS grain returns the list of all the fully qualified DNS services in "
"the system.  Collecting this information is usually a fast process, but if "
"the DNS settings have been misconfigured, it could take a much longer time.  "
"In some cases, the client could become unresponsive, or crash."
msgstr "FQDNS grain ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ບໍລິການ DNS ທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ (fully qualified) ທັງໝົດໃນລະບົບ. ການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ໄວ, ແຕ່ຖ້າຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ຜິດພາດ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າປົກກະຕິ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ຫຼື ຄ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To prevent this problem, you can disable the FQDNS grain with a Salt flag.  "
"If you disable the grain, you can use a network module to provide FQDNS "
"services, without the risk of the client becoming unresponsive."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain ດ້ວຍ Salt flag. ຖ້າທ່ານປິດໃຊ້ງານ grain ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນເຄືອຂ່າຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ FQDNS ໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This only applies to older Salt clients.  If you registered your Salt client "
"recently, the FQDNS grain is disabled by default."
msgstr "ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ລຸ້ນເກົ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, FQDNS grain ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"disable the FQDNS grain:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This command restarts each client and generate Salt events that the server "
"needs to process.  If you have a large number of clients, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ Salt ທີ່ເຊີເວີຕ້ອງໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບແບັດຊ໌ (batch mode) ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Wait for the batch command to finish executing.  Do not interrupt the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງແບບແບັດຊ໌ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ຫ້າມຂັດຈັງຫວະຂະບວນການດ້ວຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in most cases, is not recoverable.  "
"{productname} monitors free space in specific directories, and has "
"configurable alerts.  For more on space management, see "
"xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໝົດສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້. {productname} ຈະກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສະເພາະ ແລະ ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການພື້ນທີ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can recover disk space by removing unused software channels.  For "
"instructions on how to delete vendor channels, see "
"xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[].  For instructions on how to "
"delete custom channels, see xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can also check how often your custom channels are synchronized.  For "
"instructions on how deal with custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຊິງຄ໌ (synchronized) ດົນປານໃດຕໍ່ຄັ້ງ. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຈັດການການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also recover disk space by cleaning up unused activation keys, "
"content lifecycle projects, and client registrations.  You can also remove "
"redundant database entries:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກູ້ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການອະນາໄມລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້, ໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນອອກໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Redundant Database Entries"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` command to list any redundant "
"database entries."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:8
msgid "Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` command to delete them."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` ເພື່ອລຶບພວກມັນອອກ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Firewalls"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: User firewall is set to block outgoing traffic by dropping the packet request. During sync with SCC, SUMA waits for an answer on each URL until it times out, eventually causing the entire refresh of the product list to timeout. Applies only to third party (non-SUSE) products, as sync with SCC needs to access locations other than SCC to verify if the if the download location is valid.
#. Consequence: The sync to SCC fails, and the third party products are not shown in the product list.
#. Fix: Configure the firewall to reject requests from SUMA instead of drop (preferred), or configure a firewall on the server (if no ability to change firewall settings)
#. Result: Sync to SCC is either able to reach the URLs required, or rejects the request so that the request fails rather than times out.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using a firewall that blocks outgoing traffic, it can either "
"``REJECT`` or ``DROP`` network requests.  If it is set to ``DROP`` then you "
"might find that synchronizing with the {scc} times out."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This occurs because the synchronization process needs to access third-party "
"repositories that provide packages for non-{suse} clients, and not just the "
"{scc}.  When the {productname} Server attempts to reach these repositories "
"to check that they are valid, the firewall drops the requests, and the "
"synchronization continues to wait for the response until it times out."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If this occurs, the synchronization takes a long time before it fails, and "
"your non-{suse} products are not shown in the product list."
msgstr "ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການຊິງຄ໌ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:5
msgid "You can fix this problem in several different ways."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The simplest method is to configure your firewall to allow access to the "
"URLs required by non-{suse} repositories.  This allows the synchronization "
"process to reach the URLs and complete successfully."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ທີ່ຄັງເກັບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຕ້ອງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຊິງຄ໌ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ໄດ້ ແລະ ສຳເລັດການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If allowing external traffic is not possible, configure your firewall to "
"``REJECT`` requests from {productname} instead of ``DROP``.  This rejects "
"requests to third-party URLs, so that the synchronization fails early rather "
"than times out, and the products are not shown in the list."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດອະນຸຍາດທຣາຟຟິກຈາກພາຍນອກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ ``REJECT`` ການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ {productname} ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ``DROP``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປະຕິເສດການຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຫາ URL ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ລົ້ມເຫຼວທັນທີແທນທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນໝົດເວລາ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If you do not have configuration access to the firewall, you can consider "
"setting up a separate firewall on the {productname} Server instead."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ, ທ່ານສາມາດພິຈາລະນາການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ແທນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Troubleshooting high sync times between {productname} Server and Proxy over "
"WAN connections"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໃຊ້ເວລາຊິງຄ໌ດົນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) ຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on what changes are executed in the WebUI or via an API call to "
"distribution or system settings, [literal]``cobbler sync`` command may be "
"required to transfer files from {productname} Server to {productname} Proxy "
"systems.  To accomplish this, {cobbler} uses a list of proxies specified in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Due to its design, [literal]``cobbler sync`` is not able to sync only the "
"changed or recently added files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Instead, executing [literal]``cobbler sync`` triggers a full sync of the "
"[literal]``/srv/tftpboot`` directory to all specified proxies configured in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``.  It is also influenced by the latency of "
"the WAN connection between the involved systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The process of syncing may take a considerable amount of time to finish "
"according to the logs in [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຊິງຄ໌ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນສົມຄວນກວ່າຈະສຳເລັດ ອີງຕາມບັນທຶກ (logs) ໃນ [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:6
msgid "For example, it started at:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:8
msgid "and ended at:"
msgstr "ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The transfer amount was roughly 1.8 GB.  The transfer took almost 30 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນປະມານ 1.8 GB. ການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນໃຊ້ເວລາເກືອບ 30 ນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By comparison, copying a single big file of the same size as "
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` completes within several minutes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອປຽບທຽບແລ້ວ, ການກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພຽງໄຟລ໌ດຽວທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ [literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ແມ່ນສຳເລັດພາຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດນາທີ."

#. == Resolution and analysis
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Switching to an [literal]``rsync``-based approach to copy files between "
"{productname} Server and Proxy may help to reduce the transfer and wait "
"times."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ວິທີທີ່ອີງໃສ່ [literal]``rsync`` ເພື່ອກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນເວລາໃນການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການລໍຖ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A script to accomplish this task is available for download at "
"https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອປະຕິບັດໜ້າທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດທີ່ https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The script does not accept command line options.  Before running the script, "
"you need to manually edit it and set correctly [literal]``SUMAHOSTNAME``, "
"[literal]``SUMAIP`` and [literal]``SUMAPROXY1`` variables for it to work "
"correctly."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກໃນຄຳສັ່ງ (command line options). ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປ [literal]``SUMAHOSTNAME``, [literal]``SUMAIP`` ແລະ [literal]``SUMAPROXY1`` ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:15
msgid ""
"There is no support available for individual adjustments of the script.  The "
"script and the comments inside aim to provide an overview of the process and "
"steps to be taken into consideration.  If further help is required, contact "
"SUSE Consulting."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສະຄຣິບເປັນລາຍບຸກຄົນ. ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments) ຂ້າງໃນມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ. ຖ້າຫາກຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The proposed approach using the script is beneficial in the following "
"environment:"
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ນຳສະເໜີໂດຍການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນີ້ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:17
msgid "SUSE Manager Proxy systems are connected via a WAN connection;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` contains a high number of files for distributions "
"and client PXE boot files, in total several thousand files;"
msgstr "[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການແຈກຢາຍ (distributions) ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ບູດ PXE ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເຊິ່ງມີທັງໝົດຫຼາຍພັນໄຟລ໌;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Any proxy in [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settingsl`` has been disabled, "
"otherwise {productname} will continue to sync content to the proxies."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy2.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
msgstr ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy.sumaproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"sumaproxy2.sumaproxy.test\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:21
msgid "Procedure: Analyze new sync speed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Take a dump of the TCP traffic between {productname} and the involved "
"systems."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (dump) ທຣາຟຟິກ TCP ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:23
msgid "On SUSE Manager Server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:25
msgid "On SUSE Manager Proxy:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This will only capture a package size of 200 which is sufficient to run an "
"analysis."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຂະໜາດ 200 ເຊິ່ງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Adjust ethX to the respective network interface {productname} uses to "
"communicate with the proxy."
msgstr "ປັບ ethX ໃຫ້ເປັນອິນເຕີເຟດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ໃນການສື່ສານກັບພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:29
msgid ""
"At last, ssh communication will not be captured to reduce the number of "
"packages even further."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ການສື່ສານຜ່ານ ssh ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຈຳນວນແພັກເກດລົງຕື່ມອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:30
msgid "Start a {cobbler} sync."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To force a sync, delete the {cobbler} json cache file first and then issue "
"{cobbler} sync:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:33
msgid "When {cobbler} is finished, stop the TCPdumps."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Open the TCPdumps using Wireshark, go to [guimenu]``Statistics > "
"Conversations`` and wait for the dump to be analyzed."
msgstr "ເປີດ TCPdumps ໂດຍໃຊ້ Wireshark, ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Statistics > Conversations`` ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຖືກວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Switch to the TCP tab.  The number shown on this tab gives the total number "
"of conversations captured between SUSE Manager and SUSE Manager Proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:36
msgid "Look for the column [guimenu]``Duration``."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຖັນ [guimenu]``Duration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Start by sorting in ascending order to find out the minimal amount of time "
"it took to transfer a file."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາເວລາທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການໂອນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Continue by sorting in descending order to find out the maximum values for "
"the big files, for example kernel and initrd transfers."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫາໜ້ອຍ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໂອນ kernel ແລະ initrd."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:39
msgid "Ignore ports 4505 and 4506 as these are used for Salt communication."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຂ້າມພອດ 4505 ແລະ 4506 ເພາະພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານ Salt."

#. === Conclusion 
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Analysis of the TCPdumps showed the transfer of small files with a size of "
"approx. 1800 bytes from {productname} Server to Proxy took around 0.3 "
"seconds."
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະ TCPdumps ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າການໂອນໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 1800 ໄບຕ໌ ຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ ໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 0.3 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:41
msgid ""
"While there were not many big files, the high number of smaller files "
"resulted high number of established connections as new TCP connection is "
"created for every single transferred file."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ຫຼວງຫຼາຍເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ເພາະມີການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໃໝ່ສຳລັບທຸກໆໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Therefore, knowing the minimal amount of transfer time and a number of "
"connections needed (approx. 5000 in the example), gives an approximate "
"estimated time for the overall transfer time: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 minutes."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອຮູ້ເວລາການໂອນທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ປະມານ 5000 ໃນຕົວຢ່າງ), ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະມານເວລາການໂອນທັງໝົດໄດ້ຄື: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 ນາທີ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Showing my working. --LKB 2020-06-22
#. Cause: Renaming the hostname
#. Consequence: Changes not picked up by db, clients and proxies
#. Fix: Use the [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script to update the settings in the PostgreSQL database and the internal structures of {productname}.
#. Result: Renaming is successfully propagated
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you change the hostname of the {productname} Server locally, your "
"{productname} installation ceases to work properly.  This is because the "
"changes have not been made in the database, which prevents the changes from "
"propagating out your clients and any proxies."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໂດຍກົງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ປົກກະຕິ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຮັດໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If you need to change the hostname of the {productname} Server, you can do "
"so using the [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script.  This script "
"updates the settings in the {postgresql} database and the internal "
"structures of {productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename``. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ຈະອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script is part of the "
"[package]``spacewalk-utils`` package."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-utils``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The only mandatory parameter for the script is the newly configured IP "
"address of the {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Change the network settings of the server on the system level locally and "
"remotely at the DNS server."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຊີເວີໃນລະດັບລະບົບທັງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ DNS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You also need to provide configuration settings for reverse name "
"resolution.  Changing network settings is done in the same way as with "
"renaming any other system."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການແປງຊື່ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (reverse name resolution). ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍແມ່ນເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບການປ່ຽນຊື່ລະບົບອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Reboot the {productname} Server to use the new network configuration and to "
"ensure the hostname has changed."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ໂຮສໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Run the script [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script with the public "
"IP address of the server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If the server is not using the new hostname, the script fails.  Be aware "
"that this script refreshes the pillar data for all {salt} clients: the time "
"it takes to run depends on the number of registered clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Skip this step if the clients are managed via a {productname} proxy.*\n"
"Re-configure the clients directly managed to make them aware of the new "
"hostname and IP address.\n"
"In the {salt} client configuration file, you must specify the name of the "
"new {salt} master ({productname} Server) (the filename is "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-bundle/minion``or, if you do not use the {salt} "
"bundle, [path]``/etc/salt/minion``):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: <new_hostname>\n"
msgstr "master: <new_hostname>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Restart the [systemitem]``venv-salt-minion`` service (if using the {salt} "
"bundle):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:16
msgid "Or the [systemitem]``salt-minion`` service (if not using the {salt} bundle):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:18
msgid ""
"To fully propagate the hostname to the {salt} client configuration apply the "
"high state.  Applying the high state will update the hostname in the "
"repository URLs."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Any proxy must be reconfigured.  The new server certificate and key must be "
"copied to the proxy and the [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` script must be "
"run.  For more information about configuring a proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Directly connected traditional clients have the "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date`` configuration file that must be "
"changed.  With a re-activation key you can re-register traditional clients "
"(if there are any)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On traditional clients behind a proxy, as root, copy "
"[file]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` from the proxy to "
"the client, and run [command]``update-ca-certificates`` on the traditional "
"client (replace [literal]``<proxy FQDN>`` with the fully qualified domain "
"name or your proxy):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /etc/pki/trust/anchors\n"
"mv RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.old\n"
"scp <proxy FQDN>:/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"
"update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you use PXE boot through a proxy, you must check the configuration "
"settings of the proxy.  On the proxy, run the "
"[command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` setup script and enter the requested "
"information.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inactive clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A Taskomatic job periodically pings clients to ensure they are connected.  "
"Clients are considered inactive if they have not responded to a Taskomatic "
"check in for 24 hours or more.  To see a list of inactive clients in the "
"{webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."
msgstr "ວຽກຂອງ Taskomatic ຈະປິງ (ping) ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຖ້າພວກມັນບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການກວດສອບຂອງ Taskomatic ເປັນເວລາ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:3
msgid "Clients can become inactive for a number of reasons:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດກາຍເປັນບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:4
msgid "The client is not entitled to any {productname} service."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ມີສິດນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການໃດໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:5
msgid "On traditional clients, the [clientitem]``rhnsd`` service has been disabled."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:6
msgid "The client is behind a firewall that does not allow HTTPS connections."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTPS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:7
msgid "The client is behind a proxy that is misconfigured."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງພຣັອກຊີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The client is communicating with a different {productname} Server, or the "
"connection has been misconfigured."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ອື່ນ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The client is not in a network that can communicate with the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A firewall is blocking traffic between the client and the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໄຟວໍກຳລັງບລັອກທຣາຟຟິກລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:11
msgid "Taskomatic is misconfigured."
msgstr "Taskomatic ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about client connections to the server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫາເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:ports.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewalls, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common problems you might encounter with "
"{productname}, and solutions to resolving them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with ``ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError``.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS) ໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ (caches) ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. ແຄຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດບັກ (bugs) ທີ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ບັກອາດຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນລຸ້ນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ເພາະວ່າແຄຊ໌ຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່. ຖ້າທ່ານອັບເກຣດ ISS ເປັນລຸ້ນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງແຄຊ໌ທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າທີ່ກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊ໌ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບແຄຊ໌ໃນ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ ISS Caching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Local Issuer Certificates)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an ``Unrecognized error`` "
"about the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the "
"local issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"[path]``/etc/ssl/certs/`` directory.  If you come across this problem, you "
"should consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper "
"operates as expected."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງອັນສ້າງລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຜິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ zypper ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``Unrecognized error`` ກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກສ້າງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດສອບໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/ssl/certs/``. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ zypper ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 30{nbsp}ນາທີ. ອີງຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"and [path]``web.xml``.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, and in minutes in [path]``web.xml``.  The two "
"values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ [path]``web.xml``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນວິນາທີໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເປັນນາທີໃນ [path]``web.xml``. ທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບໄລຍະເວລາດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` to 3600 seconds, and the value in [path]``web.xml`` to 60 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າການໝົດເວລາເປັນໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ເປັນ 3600 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``web.xml`` ເປັນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
