#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To increase the connection timeout for SMTP server communication, the "
"following parameters can be set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ SMTP, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ (Mounting) /tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from [path]``/tmp`` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount [path]``/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` "
"option.  The other way to solve this issue is to override temporary "
"directory path with the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable specified "
"for the Salt service to make it pointing to the directory with no "
"[option]``noexec`` option set.  It is recommended to use systemd drop-in "
"configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"Salt Bundle is used, or "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"[package]``salt-minion`` is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in "
"configuration file content:"
msgstr "Salt ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈາກ [path]``/tmp`` ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ເມົາທ໌ [path]``/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ແມ່ນການຂຽນທັບ (override) ເສັ້ນທາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊົ່ວຄາວດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [literal]``TMPDIR`` ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບບໍລິການ Salt ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຊີ້ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``noexec``. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ systemd drop-in [path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຖ້າໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ຫຼື [path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຖ້າໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງເນື້ອໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ /var/tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"Salt commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ໃຊ້ [path]``/var/tmp`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Python ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ເມົາທ໌ [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ມັນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະບູດສະແຕຣັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີການເມົາທ໌ [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍ [option]``noexec`` ຜ່ານ {webui} ໄດ້ ເພາະວ່າຂະບວນການບູດສະແຕຣັບໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Check the available disk space before you begin migration.  We recommend "
"locating [path]``/var/spacewalk`` and [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` on separate "
"XFS file systems."
msgstr "ກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ວ່າງກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍ (migration). ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [path]``/var/spacewalk`` ແລະ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ທີ່ແຍກກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are setting up a separate file system, edit [path]``/etc/fstab`` "
"and remove the [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` subvolume.  Reboot the server to "
"pick up the changes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ແລະ ລຶບ subvolume [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` ອອກ. ເລີ່ມລະບົບເຊີເວີໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To get more information about an upgrade problem, check the migration log "
"file.  The log file is located at [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` on "
"the system you are upgrading."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກການຍ້າຍ (migration log). ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຈະຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` ໃນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Notifications"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default lifetime of notification messages is 30 days, after which "
"messages are deleted from the database, regardless of read status.  To "
"change this value, add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນແມ່ນ 30 ວັນ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງວ່າຈະອ່ານແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"
msgstr "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To enable or disable a notification type, add or edit a line as follows in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວດັ່ງນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"
msgstr ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For default settings and configuration options, see the "
"[path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`` template file."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ [path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Open Enterprise Server (OES) ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ຈາກ Microfocus ທີ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ OES."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການເພີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ Microfocus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` and wait "
"for the refresh operation to complete."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຣີເຟຣຊສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES ຄວນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຣີເຟຣຊແລ້ວ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OES, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OSAD and jabberd"
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In some cases, the maximum number of files that jabber can open is lower "
"than the number of connected OSAD clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If this occurs, OSAD clients cannot contact the SUSE Manager Server, and "
"jabberd takes an excessive amount of time to respond on port 5222."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This fix is only required if you have more than 8192 clients connected using "
"OSAD.  In this case, we recommend you consider using Salt clients instead.  "
"For more information about tuning large scale installations, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can increase the number of files available to jabber by editing the "
"jabberd local configuration file.  By default, the file is located at "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/jabberd.service.d/override.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the Maximum File Count"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"At the command prompt, as root, open the local configuration file for "
"editing:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl edit jabberd\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:9
msgid "Add or edit this section:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"LimitNOFILE=<soft_limit>:<hard_limit>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The value you choose varies depending on your environment.  For example, if "
"you have 9500 clients, increase the soft value by 100 to 9600, and the hard "
"value by 1000 to 10500:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Unit]\n"
"LimitNOFILE=\n"
"LimitNOFILE=9600:10500\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:13
msgid "Save the file and exit the editor."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The default editor for systemctl files is vim.  To save the file and exit, "
"press kbd:[Esc] to enter ``normal`` mode, type kbd:[:wq] and press "
"kbd:[Enter]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you also update the `max_fds` parameter in "
"[path]``/etc/jabberd/c2s.xml``.  For example: `<max_fds>10500</max_fds>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-osadjabberd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The soft file limit is the maximum number of open files for a single "
"process.  In {productname} the highest consuming process is ``c2s``, which "
"opens a connection per client.  100 additional files are added, here, to "
"accommodate for any non-connection file that ``c2s`` requires to work "
"correctly.  The hard limit applies to all processes belonging to jabber, and "
"also accounts for open files from the router, ``c2s`` and ``sm`` processes."
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#. Delinking per https://github.com/SUSE/spacewalk/issues/9516 LKB 2019-09-23
#. == jabberd Database Corruption
#. ``SYMPTOMS``: After _a disk is full error_ or a _disk crash event_, the [systemitem]``jabberd`` database may have become corrupted.
#. [systemitem]``jabberd`` may then fail starting Spacewalk services:
#. ----
#. Starting spacewalk services...
#.    Initializing jabberd processes...
#.        Starting router                                                                   done
#.        Starting sm startproc:  exit status of parent of /usr/bin/sm: 2                   failed
#.    Terminating jabberd processes...
#. ----
#. [path]``/var/log/messages`` shows more details:
#. ----
#. jabberd/sm[31445]: starting up
#. jabberd/sm[31445]: process id is 31445, written to /var/lib/jabberd/pid/sm.pid
#. jabberd/sm[31445]: loading 'db' storage module
#. jabberd/sm[31445]: db: corruption detected! close all jabberd processes and run db_recover
#. jabberd/router[31437]: shutting down
#. ----
#. ``CURE``: Remove the [systemitem]``jabberd`` database and restart.
#. [systemitem]``jabberd`` automatically re-creates the database.
#. Enter at the command prompt:
#. ----
#. spacewalk-service stop
#. rm -rf /var/lib/jabberd/db/*
#. spacewalk-service start
#. ----
#.    ke, 2019-08-08: not sure whether we want this here:
#. An alternative approach would be to test another database, but SUSE Manager does not deliver drivers for this:
#. ----
#. rcosa-dispatcher stop
#. rcjabberd stop
#. cd /var/lib/jabberd/db
#. rm *
#. cp /usr/share/doc/packages/jabberd/db-setup.sqlite .
#. sqlite3 sqlite.db < db-setup.sqlite
#. chown jabber:jabber *
#. rcjabberd start
#. rcosa-dispatcher start
#. ----
#. Delinking per https://github.com/SUSE/spacewalk/issues/9516 LKB 2019-09-23
#. == Capturing XMPP Network Data for Debugging Purposes
#. If you are experiencing bugs regarding OSAD, it can be useful to dump network messages to help with debugging.
#. The following procedures provide information on capturing data from both the client and server side.
#. .Procedure: Server Side Capture
#. . Install the [package]#tcpdump# package on the server as root:
#. +
#. ----
#. zypper in tcpdump
#. ----
#. . Stop the OSA dispatcher and Jabber processes:
#. +
#. ----
#. rcosa-dispatcher stop
#. rcjabberd stop
#. ----
#. . Start data capture on port 5222:
#. +
#. ----
#. tcpdump -s 0 port 5222 -w server_dump.pcap
#. ----
#. . Open a second terminal and start the OSA dispatcher and Jabber processes:
#. +
#. ----
#. rcosa-dispatcher start
#. rcjabberd start
#. ----
#. . Operate the server and clients so the bug you formerly experienced is reproduced.
#. . When you have finished your capture re-open the first terminal and stop the data capture with kbd:[CTRL+c].
#. .Procedure: Client Side Capture
#. . Install the tcpdump package on your client as root:
#. +
#. ----
#. zypper in tcpdump
#. ----
#. . Stop the OSA process:
#. +
#. ----
#. rcosad stop
#. ----
#. . Begin data capture on port 5222:
#. +
#. ----
#. tcpdump -s 0 port 5222 -w client_client_dump.pcap
#. ----
#. . Open a second terminal and start the OSA process:
#. +
#. ----
#. rcosad start
#. ----
#. . Operate the server and clients so the bug you formerly experienced is reproduced.
#. . When you have finished your capture re-open the first terminal and stop the data capture with kbd:[CTRL+c].
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Repository Via Proxy Issues"
msgstr ""

#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In some occasions the [systemitem]``squid`` cache on the proxy gets "
"corrupted.  When this occurs getting packages or repositories metadata on a "
"client connected to the proxy fails with various possible error messages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cleaning the [systemitem]``squid`` cache is done differently on a regular or "
"a container proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:4
msgid "For a regular proxy, follow this procedure on the proxy machine:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop squid\n"
"rm -rf /var/cache/squid/*\n"
"squid -z\n"
"systemctl start squid\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For a container proxy running with [systemitem]``podman``, follow this "
"procedure on the host machine:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages-proxy.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
"podman volume rm uyuni-proxy-squid-cache\n"
"systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງຂອງແພັກເກດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລັອກໄວ້, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຊຸດຂອງແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclude lists) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` and search "
"for ``exclude=``."
msgstr "ໃນແພລັດຟອມ Expanded Support, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ ``exclude=``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the [command]``zypper locks`` command."
msgstr "ໃນ {sle} ແລະ {opensuse}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper locks``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການສົ່ງ Grains ໄປຫາ Start Event"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the ``machine_id`` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງ grain ``machine_id`` ໄປຫາ {productname}. {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ grain ນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຕ້ອງການການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (synchronous). ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດຈະບລັອກຂະບວນການອື່ນໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມກັນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຊັກຊ້າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳສະເໜີໃນ Salt ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls`` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the ``start_event_grains`` configuration helper:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວຊ່ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``start_event_grains``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບແບັດຊ໌ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {payg}"
msgstr ""

#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "ກຳລັງກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "ຫາກສະຄຣິບບໍ່ສາມາດເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄດ້, ມັນຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ Log ແລະ ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If the credentials are not working, [literal]``reposync`` should show the "
"proper error."
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້, [literal]``reposync`` ຄວນສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using [literal]``registercloudguest``"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ [literal]``registercloudguest``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the [literal]``registercloudguest`` connection to the "
"public cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials "
"usage."
msgstr "ການຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [literal]``registercloudguest`` ໄປຫາໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດ Public Cloud ບໍ່ຄວນລົບກວນການນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-payg.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Running [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` will cause problems if no "
"new cloud connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "ການລັນ [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Cloud ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ cloud guest."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີຈະປາກົດໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າພວກມັນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ (FQDN) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs as grains in the client "
"configuration file on the proxy:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ FQDN ເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນ grains ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ທີ່ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {payglongform} Behind Proxy"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {payglongform} ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To identify if a machine is {payg} or not, {productname} needs to use "
"[literal]``sudo`` to run [literal]``instance-flavor-check``tool."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າເຄື່ອງນັ້ນແມ່ນ {payg} ຫຼື ບໍ່, {productname} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [literal]``sudo`` ເພື່ອລັນເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``instance-flavor-check``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the customer is using a http proxy, they need to make sure this setting "
"is correctly managed by [literal]``sudo``, because by default most "
"environment variables are disregarded."
msgstr "ຫາກລູກຄ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ http proxy, ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍ [literal]``sudo``, ເພາະວ່າໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment variables) ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"One way to do it, is to add a file [path]``/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf`` "
"with the following content:"
msgstr "ວິທີໜຶ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຄືການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This ensures the proxy related environment variables are preserved during "
"the privileges escalation."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ proxy ຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍົກລະດັບສິດ (privileges escalation)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ {webui} ລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຈາກ {webui}, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດຈະໃຊ້ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທຳມະຊາດຂອງມັນ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບຄືນໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at "
"[path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະເກັບບັນທຶກ (log) ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ [path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Troubleshooting Registering a traditional client as Salt minion after "
"deleting it"
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This is not a valid scenario. Normally you migrate a traditional client to a "
"Salt minion without deleting the client.  Salt automatically detects that "
"you have a traditional client and does the necessary changes itself. But if "
"you somehow deleted the traditional client and want to register it as a Salt "
"minion again, you have to do the following steps on the client before "
"registering it as Salt minion:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:3
msgid "Remove the following file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:5
msgid "Remove the following package:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypp-plugin-spacewalk\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VMs), ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງໂຄນ (clones) ຂອງ VMs ຂອງທ່ານ. ໂຄນແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິສກ໌ຫຼັກທີ່ເປັນການກັອບປີ້ທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກປະການຈາກດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການໂຄນ VMs ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນດິສກ໌ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສ້າງໂຄນຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ, ແລ້ວພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ Machine ID ທັງໃນເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເຄື່ອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເດີມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ Machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປປ່ຽນແປງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Make sure [path]``/etc/hosts`` contains the changes you made and the correct "
"host entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ປະກອບດ້ວຍການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນໂຮສທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For distributions that support systemd: If your machines have the same "
"machine ID, as root, delete the files on each duplicated client and "
"re-create it:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in [path]``/var/log/journal/`` it "
"needs to be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID.  If names do not "
"match, [command]``journalctl`` could not retrieve any log and "
"[command]``podman logs`` would not show anything."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນມີໂຟນເດີໃນ [path]``/var/log/journal/`` ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ຕາມ Machine ID ໃໝ່. ຖ້າຊື່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, [command]``journalctl`` ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງບັນທຶກໃດໆໄດ້ ແລະ [command]``podman logs`` ກໍຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງເລີຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For distributions that do not support systemd: As root, generate a machine "
"ID from dbus:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the "
"[path]``minion_id`` file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated "
"on client restart).  For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງມີ Salt client ID ດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ [path]``minion_id`` ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ (FQDN ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງໃໝ່ຕອນເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່). ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with.  For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ລຶບຄີ (keys) ທີ່ຍອມຮັບແລ້ວອອກຈາກໜ້າ onboarding ແລະ ລຶບ system profile ອອກຈາກ {productname}, ແລ້ວເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່. ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid "Re-register the clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Each client now has a different [path]``/etc/machine-id`` and should be "
"correctly displayed on the [guimenu]``System Overview`` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Traditional Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Stop the [systemitem]``rhnsd`` daemon, on {rhnminrelease6} and {sle} 11 "
"with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/rhnsd stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid "or, on newer systemd-based systems, with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "service rhnsd stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
msgid "Stop [systemitem]``osad`` with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/osad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:37
msgid "or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "service osad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcosad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Remove the [systemitem]``osad`` authentication configuration file and the "
"system ID:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/sysconfig/rhn/{osad-auth.conf,systemid}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:41
msgid "Delete the files containing the machine IDs:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:42
msgid "SLES{nbsp}12:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:44
msgid "SLES{nbsp}11:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "suse_register -E\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:46
msgid "Remove the credential files:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:47
msgid "SLES clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/zypp/credentials.d/{SCCcredentials,NCCcredentials}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:49
msgid "{rhel} clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm  -f /etc/NCCcredentials\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:51
msgid "Re-run the bootstrap script."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:52
msgid ""
"You should now see the cloned system in {productname} without overriding the "
"system it was cloned from."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Traditional Red Hat Clients"
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Traditional RHEL 7 and SLES-ES 7 clients require some unsigned packages in order to work properly with {productname}, so custom channels for these client types usually unset the gpgcheck flag.
#. However, the rhnplugin.conf file overrides this setting, and enables the GPG check.
#. Consequence: When traditional RHEL 7 or SLES-ES 7 clients are registered, the client will not install unsigned packages from the custom channel, even if the gpgcheck is disabled in the custom channel.
#. Fix: Edit the /etc/yum/pluginconf.d/rhnplugin.conf file to disable the GPG check.
#. Result: Unsigned packages can be installed as required, and the clients will work as expected.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 and SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients require some unsigned "
"packages to work properly with {productname}, so custom channels for these "
"client types usually unset the ``gpgcheck`` flag.  However, the "
"``rhnplugin.conf`` file overrides this setting, and enables the GPG check."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This means that when traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 and SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients "
"are registered, the client will not install unsigned packages from the "
"custom channel, even if the ``gpgcheck`` is disabled in the custom channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, edit the ``/etc/yum/pluginconf.d/rhnplugin.conf`` "
"file and disable the GPG check to enable installation of unsigned packages, "
"and allow the clients to work as expected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-retrying-setup-target-system.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Retrying to Set up the Target System"
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#
#
